Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.24,0:01:03.75,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1024,600)}裤头村
Dialogue: 1,0:01:10.34,0:01:11.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.34,0:01:11.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Look
Dialogue: 1,0:01:11.50,0:01:13.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,又找到了个橡皮塞
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.50,0:01:13.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Another rubber stopper
Dialogue: 1,0:01:13.46,0:01:15.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可以给我橡皮塞收藏再加一个了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.46,0:01:15.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,for my rubber stopper collection
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.27,0:01:27.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好一个专属于我的小世界
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.27,0:01:27.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's a little land that's all mine
Dialogue: 1,0:01:28.06,0:01:29.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在我的小世界下雪了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.06,0:01:29.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now it's snowing in my little land
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.48,0:01:34.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,又下雪了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.48,0:01:34.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's snowing again
Dialogue: 1,0:01:42.58,0:01:45.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的小世界一定是地震了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.58,0:01:45.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My little land must be having an earthquake
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.46,0:01:52.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一定是余震
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.46,0:01:52.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Must have been an aftershock
Dialogue: 1,0:01:59.18,0:02:01.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怪不得你会生气
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.18,0:02:01.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No wonder you're angry
Dialogue: 1,0:02:01.30,0:02:04.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只要倒过来就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.30,0:02:04.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You just got to turn it upside down
Dialogue: 1,0:02:04.39,0:02:05.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.39,0:02:05.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.34,0:02:39.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,75,,很久很久以后
Dialogue: 1,0:02:44.22,0:02:46.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,雪花球总是很好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.22,0:02:46.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Snow globes are always funny
Dialogue: 1,0:02:50.10,0:02:51.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要闻闻我的胳肢窝吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.10,0:02:51.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You want to smell my armpit?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:52.48,0:02:53.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你闻吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.48,0:02:53.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There you go
Dialogue: 1,0:03:04.74,0:03:05.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.74,0:03:05.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thanks
Dialogue: 1,0:03:07.79,0:03:09.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,喜欢玩鬼抓人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.79,0:03:09.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Do you like to play tag?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:12.04,0:03:14.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,以前从来没玩过吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.04,0:03:14.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Never played it before, huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:14.92,0:03:18.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对  解释起来有点难
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.92,0:03:18.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's kind of hard to explain
Dialogue: 1,0:03:19.30,0:03:20.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要不要来玩捉迷藏
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.30,0:03:20.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How about hide and seek?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:23.01,0:03:23.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不对不对
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.01,0:03:23.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, no, no
Dialogue: 1,0:03:23.76,0:03:25.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这个很简单的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.76,0:03:25.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This one's easy
Dialogue: 1,0:03:25.05,0:03:29.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只要闭上眼睛  等别人躲
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.05,0:03:29.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You just close your eyes while the other guy hides
Dialogue: 1,0:03:29.31,0:03:31.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,然后找到躲的人就赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.31,0:03:31.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and then you find him and you win
Dialogue: 1,0:03:31.48,0:03:32.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.48,0:03:32.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:32.31,0:03:33.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,准备
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.31,0:03:33.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Ready
Dialogue: 1,0:03:33.77,0:03:35.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快去躲起来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.77,0:03:35.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now go hide
Dialogue: 1,0:03:35.06,0:03:36.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一二三
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.06,0:03:36.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,One, two, three
Dialogue: 1,0:03:36.27,0:03:37.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我能跳过几个数
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.27,0:03:37.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can skip a few
Dialogue: 1,0:03:37.27,0:03:37.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一百
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.27,0:03:37.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,100
Dialogue: 1,0:03:37.86,0:03:40.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,准备好了没  我来找了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.86,0:03:40.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, ready or not, here I come
Dialogue: 1,0:03:43.24,0:03:44.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你哪去了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.24,0:03:44.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where'd you go?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:46.62,0:03:48.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,干嘛要躲着我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.62,0:03:48.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why are you hiding from me?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:50.37,0:03:52.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这游戏比我想的还要难
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.37,0:03:52.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This game's harder than I thought
Dialogue: 1,0:03:56.13,0:03:58.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,又想闻我胳肢窝了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.13,0:03:58.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You want to smell my armpit again?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:01.51,0:04:02.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你又赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.51,0:04:02.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You win again
Dialogue: 1,0:04:04.47,0:04:07.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要去见见我朋友海绵宝宝吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.47,0:04:07.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You want to go meet my friend SpongeBob?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:07.89,0:04:09.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,虽然他有点怪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.89,0:04:09.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He's a little weird
Dialogue: 1,0:04:09.39,0:04:11.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但估计你们能合得来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.39,0:04:11.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but you guys will probably get along
Dialogue: 1,0:04:14.48,0:04:17.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等会儿还能再来玩珊瑚套圈
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.48,0:04:17.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We can play more coral ring toss later
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.65,0:04:21.15,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(494,736)}小蜗
Dialogue: 1,0:04:19.57,0:04:21.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,晚餐时间到  小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.57,0:04:21.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Dinnertime, Gary
Dialogue: 1,0:04:21.32,0:04:22.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,而且还是你最爱的口味
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.32,0:04:22.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And it's your favorite flavor
Dialogue: 1,0:04:23.11,0:04:25.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,碎海葵副产品和磷虾
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.11,0:04:25.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Crushed anemone by-products and krill
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.40,0:04:25.16,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1138,422)}有机蜗牛点心
Dialogue: 1,0:04:26.37,0:04:28.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,外面什么巨响这么恐怖
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.37,0:04:28.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What is that horrific banging?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:34.46,0:04:37.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有个巨大海怪在吃派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.46,0:04:37.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick's being eaten by a giant sea monster
Dialogue: 1,0:04:38.96,0:04:40.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他在求救
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.96,0:04:40.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He's crying out for help
Dialogue: 1,0:04:40.96,0:04:42.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.96,0:04:42.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:04:42.84,0:04:43.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看上面
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.84,0:04:43.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Up here
Dialogue: 1,0:04:44.38,0:04:44.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.38,0:04:44.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Look
Dialogue: 1,0:04:45.43,0:04:46.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我没用手
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.43,0:04:46.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No hands
Dialogue: 1,0:04:47.14,0:04:49.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小蜗  情况比昨天还严重
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.14,0:04:49.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gary, this is even worse than yesterday
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.26,0:04:50.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,75,,昨天
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.43,0:04:52.10,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(404,452)}蟹堡王
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.10,0:04:55.44,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(886,188)}冰               汽水
Dialogue: 1,0:04:56.90,0:04:57.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.90,0:04:57.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Excuse me
Dialogue: 1,0:04:57.73,0:04:59.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们制冰机好像坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.73,0:04:59.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I think your ice machine's broken
Dialogue: 1,0:04:59.69,0:05:00.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,继续找
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.69,0:05:00.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Keep looking
Dialogue: 1,0:05:00.61,0:05:01.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,迟早会找到在乎的那位
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.61,0:05:01.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You'll find someone who cares
Dialogue: 1,0:05:03.11,0:05:04.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你是这里的老板对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.11,0:05:04.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're the owner here, aren't you?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:04.45,0:05:05.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就是我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.45,0:05:05.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That would be me
Dialogue: 1,0:05:06.57,0:05:08.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们的制冰机好像坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.57,0:05:08.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, I think your ice machine might be broken
Dialogue: 1,0:05:09.78,0:05:11.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,去跟那边那位说
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.78,0:05:11.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Try telling that guy over there
Dialogue: 1,0:05:13.62,0:05:14.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.62,0:05:14.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Excuse me
Dialogue: 1,0:05:15.04,0:05:16.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,制冰机坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.04,0:05:16.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The ice machine's broken
Dialogue: 1,0:05:18.96,0:05:22.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.96,0:05:22.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:05:23.13,0:05:24.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.13,0:05:24.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:25.13,0:05:26.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.13,0:05:26.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:27.47,0:05:29.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.47,0:05:29.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:29.72,0:05:33.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.72,0:05:33.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:33.97,0:05:35.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,太可怕了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.97,0:05:35.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It was horrible
Dialogue: 1,0:05:37.14,0:05:37.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.14,0:05:37.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:05:38.27,0:05:39.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.27,0:05:39.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:05:39.27,0:05:40.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.27,0:05:40.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:05:40.36,0:05:41.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我一定是做了白日梦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.36,0:05:41.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I must have been daydreaming
Dialogue: 1,0:05:41.90,0:05:44.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我看到你在大怪物湿淋淋的大嘴里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.90,0:05:44.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I saw you in this big monster's dripping maw
Dialogue: 1,0:05:44.15,0:05:45.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还以为怪物在吃你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.15,0:05:45.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and I thought you were being eaten
Dialogue: 1,0:05:45.86,0:05:48.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,它可没吃我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.86,0:05:48.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, I wasn't being eaten
Dialogue: 1,0:05:48.07,0:05:49.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那怪物是我朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.07,0:05:49.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That monster is my friend
Dialogue: 1,0:05:49.82,0:05:51.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我觉得你应该会想认识一下他
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.82,0:05:51.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I thought you might like to meet him
Dialogue: 1,0:05:51.78,0:05:53.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我很乐意能认识他
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.78,0:05:53.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I would be delighted to meet him
Dialogue: 1,0:05:53.62,0:05:56.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那样的话  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.62,0:05:56.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, in that case, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:05:56.50,0:05:58.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我想把你介绍给
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.50,0:05:58.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I would like to introduce you to
Dialogue: 1,0:05:59.75,0:06:01.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我想把你介绍给
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.75,0:06:01.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I would like to introduce you to--
Dialogue: 1,0:06:03.00,0:06:04.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,忘记他名字了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.00,0:06:04.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I forgot his name
Dialogue: 1,0:06:04.38,0:06:04.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.38,0:06:04.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:04.84,0:06:05.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.84,0:06:05.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:05.51,0:06:06.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别慌
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.51,0:06:06.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't panic
Dialogue: 1,0:06:06.63,0:06:08.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,先介绍我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.63,0:06:08.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Introduce me first
Dialogue: 1,0:06:08.05,0:06:09.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等他认识了我  就会自报姓名了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.05,0:06:09.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Then he'll say his name when he meets me
Dialogue: 1,0:06:09.89,0:06:10.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.89,0:06:10.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 1,0:06:11.39,0:06:15.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我想让你认识一下我朋友海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.39,0:06:15.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'd like you to meet my friend SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:06:16.14,0:06:17.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,请问你是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.14,0:06:17.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And you are?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:17.94,0:06:21.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,吼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.94,0:06:21.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Rrarrg
Dialogue: 1,0:06:22.23,0:06:25.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,很高兴认识你  吼先生
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.23,0:06:25.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you, Mr. Rrarrg
Dialogue: 1,0:06:28.90,0:06:30.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好了  吼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.90,0:06:30.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, rrarrg
Dialogue: 1,0:06:30.03,0:06:31.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,既然交上朋友了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.03,0:06:31.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now that we're friends
Dialogue: 1,0:06:31.20,0:06:32.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我想带你参观一下我家
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.20,0:06:32.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I would like to show you my home
Dialogue: 1,0:06:35.12,0:06:38.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这是我家
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.12,0:06:38.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And this is my home
Dialogue: 1,0:06:40.29,0:06:42.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你家在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.29,0:06:42.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where is your home?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:44.46,0:06:45.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他应该没有家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.46,0:06:45.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Maybe he doesn't have a home
Dialogue: 1,0:06:45.92,0:06:47.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没有家吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.92,0:06:47.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Doesn't have a home?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:47.92,0:06:49.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.92,0:06:49.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute
Dialogue: 1,0:06:49.01,0:06:52.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,想住我石头下就来住吧  吼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.01,0:06:52.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You could live under my rock if you want, rrarrg
Dialogue: 1,0:07:20.16,0:07:21.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他把你家给砸了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.16,0:07:21.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He smashed your house
Dialogue: 1,0:07:21.58,0:07:22.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.58,0:07:22.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:07:27.50,0:07:29.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他现在要砸你家了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.50,0:07:29.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He's gonna smash your house now
Dialogue: 1,0:07:32.13,0:07:34.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他要砸我家
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.13,0:07:34.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He's going to smash my house?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:34.22,0:07:35.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.22,0:07:35.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gary
Dialogue: 1,0:07:37.85,0:07:40.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.85,0:07:40.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gary
Dialogue: 1,0:07:40.43,0:07:41.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,跳啊  小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.43,0:07:41.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Jump, Gary
Dialogue: 1,0:07:41.35,0:07:41.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,跳啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.35,0:07:41.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Jump
Dialogue: 1,0:07:43.06,0:07:44.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,降落伞  小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.06,0:07:44.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Parachute, Gary
Dialogue: 1,0:07:44.15,0:07:45.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快用降落伞
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.15,0:07:45.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Use your parachute
Dialogue: 1,0:07:53.78,0:07:56.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他现在要砸章鱼哥家了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.78,0:07:56.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He's gonna smash Squidward's place now
Dialogue: 1,0:07:59.04,0:07:59.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  好像不
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.04,0:07:59.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, I don't--
Dialogue: 1,0:08:01.12,0:08:01.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.12,0:08:01.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Encore
Dialogue: 1,0:08:22.27,0:08:24.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,警察来了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.27,0:08:24.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The police have arrived
Dialogue: 1,0:08:24.02,0:08:25.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,而且还给吼围了个可爱小围栏
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.02,0:08:25.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And they built a cute little fence around rrarrg
Dialogue: 1,0:08:26.73,0:08:27.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,嗨  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.73,0:08:27.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hi, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:08:27.44,0:08:28.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这么早回家啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.44,0:08:28.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,you're home early
Dialogue: 1,0:08:29.53,0:08:30.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你先慢着
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.53,0:08:30.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hold it, buddy
Dialogue: 1,0:08:30.40,0:08:31.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这是要去哪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.40,0:08:31.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:31.28,0:08:32.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我住在这
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.28,0:08:32.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I live here
Dialogue: 1,0:08:35.53,0:08:37.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有什么好笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.53,0:08:37.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And what's so funny?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:37.53,0:08:39.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们在笑居然会有谁住在一堆碎石里
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.53,0:08:39.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The thought of anyone living in a pile of gravel
Dialogue: 1,0:08:39.83,0:08:41.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我倒要告诉你  先生
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.83,0:08:41.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll have you know, sir
Dialogue: 1,0:08:41.70,0:08:43.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的家可是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.70,0:08:43.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that my home is a
Dialogue: 1,0:08:43.83,0:08:45.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一堆碎石
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.83,0:08:45.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Pile of rubble?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:46.83,0:08:48.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,先生  别吼我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.83,0:08:48.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sir, don't yell at me
Dialogue: 1,0:08:48.04,0:08:48.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可不能惊动
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.04,0:08:48.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We don't want to alert the--
Dialogue: 1,0:08:48.71,0:08:50.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,惊动什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.71,0:08:50.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Alert the what?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:50.17,0:08:52.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那边围栏里面的可怕大怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.17,0:08:52.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That big scary monster inside the fence over there
Dialogue: 1,0:08:55.34,0:08:56.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他朝你招手了  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.34,0:08:56.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He waved at you, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:08:56.72,0:08:58.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,意思就是喜欢你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.72,0:08:58.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that means he likes you
Dialogue: 1,0:08:58.05,0:08:59.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他喜欢我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.05,0:08:59.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He likes me?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:00.72,0:09:02.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,警官  立刻逮捕我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.72,0:09:02.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Officer, arrest me right now
Dialogue: 1,0:09:02.85,0:09:05.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,因为我马上就要火冒三丈
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.85,0:09:05.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,because I'm about to throw a horrible tantrum
Dialogue: 1,0:09:05.02,0:09:07.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,场面多半会很难看
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.02,0:09:07.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that no one around here wants to see
Dialogue: 1,0:09:08.98,0:09:10.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你觉得他在那上面干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.98,0:09:10.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What do you think he's doing up there?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:10.94,0:09:11.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谁
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.94,0:09:11.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:11.44,0:09:12.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那个大块头
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.44,0:09:12.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The big guy
Dialogue: 1,0:09:13.86,0:09:14.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.86,0:09:14.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't know
Dialogue: 1,0:09:14.70,0:09:15.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.70,0:09:15.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:15.24,0:09:16.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我说  不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.24,0:09:16.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I said, "I don't know"
Dialogue: 1,0:09:30.54,0:09:31.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他逃跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.54,0:09:31.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He's escaped
Dialogue: 1,0:09:32.67,0:09:33.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快  全体上
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.67,0:09:33.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Quick, everybody into the--
Dialogue: 1,0:09:34.76,0:09:37.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快  全体上警车
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.76,0:09:37.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Quick, everybody into the squad car
Dialogue: 1,0:09:45.52,0:09:46.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,该死
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.52,0:09:46.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Darn it
Dialogue: 1,0:09:46.23,0:09:47.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这下该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.23,0:09:47.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now what are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:47.52,0:09:48.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,必须步行去追他
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.52,0:09:48.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We shall have to chase him on foot
Dialogue: 1,0:09:52.65,0:09:54.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他往城里去了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.65,0:09:54.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's headed straight for town
Dialogue: 1,0:10:01.16,0:10:01.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,在那
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.16,0:10:01.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There
Dialogue: 1,0:10:01.74,0:10:02.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就在杂志摊旁边
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.74,0:10:02.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,By the magazine stand
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.62,0:10:06.25,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1062,488)}报摊
Dialogue: 1,0:10:05.16,0:10:06.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不许动  小东西
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.16,0:10:06.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hold it right there, bub
Dialogue: 1,0:10:06.71,0:10:09.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这可是报摊  不是图书馆
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.71,0:10:09.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is a newsstand, not a library
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.08,0:10:11.84,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(270,258)}懒评
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.08,0:10:11.84,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1234,274)}八卦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.83,0:10:11.84,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(704,276)}有毒废料月刊
Dialogue: 1,0:10:11.84,0:10:15.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再过来一步  我就打喷嚏了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.84,0:10:15.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, one more step, and I'll sneeze
Dialogue: 1,0:10:16.21,0:10:18.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给我等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.21,0:10:18.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait just one minute
Dialogue: 1,0:10:18.88,0:10:20.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这可是我朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.88,0:10:20.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is my friend
Dialogue: 1,0:10:21.22,0:10:22.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要想逮捕他
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.22,0:10:22.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,If you want to get to him
Dialogue: 1,0:10:22.85,0:10:24.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,必须先过我这关
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.85,0:10:24.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,you're gonna have to go through me
Dialogue: 1,0:10:24.93,0:10:26.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们正有此意
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.93,0:10:26.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're prepared to do that
Dialogue: 1,0:10:27.98,0:10:28.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,其实
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.98,0:10:28.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Actually
Dialogue: 1,0:10:29.48,0:10:31.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,先让我跟他讲几句话
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.48,0:10:31.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just let me talk to him for a minute
Dialogue: 1,0:10:33.94,0:10:35.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你是说那玩意会讲话吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.94,0:10:35.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You mean that thing can speak?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:36.65,0:10:37.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那当然了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.65,0:10:37.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Of course
Dialogue: 1,0:10:37.69,0:10:39.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他可是大自然的大怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.69,0:10:39.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He's a giant freak of nature
Dialogue: 1,0:10:40.24,0:10:43.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不是大自然不会讲话的怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.24,0:10:43.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,not a freak of nature that can't speak
Dialogue: 1,0:10:50.12,0:10:54.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,卑微蜗牛蜕其壳
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.12,0:10:54.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And so as the lowly snail sheddeth his shell
Dialogue: 1,0:10:54.59,0:10:58.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,高傲海鸥脱其羽
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.59,0:10:58.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and the lofty gull molteth his feathers
Dialogue: 1,0:10:59.01,0:11:04.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,友谊无限好  只是尽黄昏
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.01,0:11:01.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,the brightest of friendships
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.30,0:11:04.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,must dimmeth as the setting sun
Dialogue: 1,0:11:04.81,0:11:05.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.81,0:11:05.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That was
Dialogue: 1,0:11:06.77,0:11:07.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,太美了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.77,0:11:07.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Beautiful
Dialogue: 1,0:11:08.56,0:11:10.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但还是得把他赶出城
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.56,0:11:10.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We still got to run him out of town
Dialogue: 1,0:11:16.40,0:11:19.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,目送他离开  让我心都碎了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.40,0:11:19.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It really crushes my heart to see him go
Dialogue: 1,0:11:19.03,0:11:20.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对啊  碎了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.03,0:11:20.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, crushes
Dialogue: 1,0:11:21.36,0:11:22.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  碎了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.36,0:11:22.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, crushes
Dialogue: 1,0:11:22.74,0:11:24.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我想到办法了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.74,0:11:24.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That gives me an idea
Dialogue: 1,0:11:29.04,0:11:29.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.04,0:11:29.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:11:30.16,0:11:30.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.16,0:11:30.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 1,0:11:31.33,0:11:32.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,请来两块
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.33,0:11:32.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Two cubes, please
Dialogue: 1,0:11:39.92,0:11:41.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你的冰块来了  先生
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.92,0:11:41.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Your ice cubes, sir
Dialogue: 1,0:11:41.38,0:11:41.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.38,0:11:41.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:41.80,0:11:42.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.80,0:11:42.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:46.01,0:11:46.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢了  兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.01,0:11:46.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thanks, buddy
Dialogue: 1,0:11:46.81,0:11:47.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别谢我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.81,0:11:47.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't thank me
Dialogue: 1,0:11:47.81,0:11:49.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢谢吼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.81,0:11:49.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thank rrarrg
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.31,0:11:53.44,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(766,706)}裤头村传说
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.44,0:11:58.11,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(738,860)}欢迎来到裤头村三角区
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.19,0:11:59.15,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz27.52\pos(238,442)}分镜总监
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.19,0:12:01.15,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1096,976.667)}翻译{\fnArial}: 1440kHz
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.19,0:11:59.15,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz27.52\pos(492,710)}编剧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.23,0:12:00.19,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.51\pos(408,444)}创意总监
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.23,0:12:00.19,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.51\pos(528,690)}动画总监
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.28,0:12:01.15,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.51\pos(432,530)}制片指导
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.32,0:12:02.32,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.51\pos(432,530)}客串
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.32,0:12:02.32,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1034.667,976.667)}本字幕仅限学习交流\N严禁用于商业用途
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.36,0:12:11.29,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1004,676)}裤头村
Dialogue: 1,0:12:18.14,0:12:19.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的闹钟呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.14,0:12:19.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where's my alarm clock?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:21.07,0:12:22.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你的壳也不见了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.07,0:12:22.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Your shell is gone too?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:23.35,0:12:24.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们家失窃了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.35,0:12:24.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I think we've been robbed
Dialogue: 1,0:12:26.92,0:12:27.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,她不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.92,0:12:27.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,She's gone
Dialogue: 1,0:12:27.89,0:12:29.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的竖笛不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.89,0:12:29.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My clarinet is missing
Dialogue: 1,0:12:30.87,0:12:32.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,确实很奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.87,0:12:32.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Strange indeed
Dialogue: 1,0:12:33.48,0:12:34.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的袖扣
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.48,0:12:34.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My cufflinks
Dialogue: 1,0:12:34.69,0:12:35.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,都不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.69,0:12:35.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,They're missing
Dialogue: 1,0:12:36.23,0:12:36.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.23,0:12:36.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:37.34,0:12:38.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.34,0:12:38.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:38.97,0:12:40.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但愿这不表示我们失去了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.97,0:12:40.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I hope this doesn't mean that we're missing
Dialogue: 1,0:12:40.70,0:12:43.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们心中最亲近的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.70,0:12:43.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,the one thing that's nearest and dearest to our hearts
Dialogue: 1,0:12:43.45,0:12:44.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没失去  我就在这
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.45,0:12:44.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nope, I'm right here
Dialogue: 1,0:12:44.73,0:12:46.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹堡王
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.73,0:12:46.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The Krusty Krab
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.70,0:12:50.20,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(344,378)}蟹堡王
Dialogue: 1,0:12:53.42,0:12:55.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,前来报到  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.42,0:12:55.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Reporting for duty, Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:12:56.83,0:12:57.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.83,0:12:57.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:58.45,0:13:00.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.45,0:13:00.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:13:01.47,0:13:02.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.47,0:13:02.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:02.94,0:13:03.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.94,0:13:03.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:04.36,0:13:05.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.36,0:13:05.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:05.67,0:13:06.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,珍珍
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.67,0:13:06.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Pearl?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:06.50,0:13:07.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你来干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.50,0:13:07.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:07.94,0:13:09.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没干嘛  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.94,0:13:09.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nothing, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:13:09.68,0:13:11.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只是在一边忙学业
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.68,0:13:11.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just trying to juggle schoolwork
Dialogue: 1,0:13:11.36,0:13:12.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一边忙社交
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.36,0:13:12.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,having a social life
Dialogue: 1,0:13:12.70,0:13:14.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一边忙着管理家族事业
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.70,0:13:14.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and running the family business
Dialogue: 1,0:13:14.37,0:13:15.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就这样
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.37,0:13:15.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's all
Dialogue: 1,0:13:16.00,0:13:17.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小题大做
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.00,0:13:17.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Drama queen
Dialogue: 1,0:13:17.07,0:13:17.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你爸去哪了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.07,0:13:17.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where's your dad?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:17.73,0:13:19.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.73,0:13:19.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't know
Dialogue: 1,0:13:19.05,0:13:21.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我今早去要零花钱的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.05,0:13:21.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,When I went to get my allowance this morning
Dialogue: 1,0:13:21.46,0:13:22.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他就不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.46,0:13:22.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,he was gone
Dialogue: 1,0:13:22.69,0:13:24.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板不见了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.69,0:13:24.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs is missing?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:24.44,0:13:26.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我竖笛不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.44,0:13:26.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm missing my clarinet
Dialogue: 1,0:13:26.12,0:13:27.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小蜗的壳也是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.12,0:13:27.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And Gary's shell
Dialogue: 1,0:13:27.24,0:13:30.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有谁看到我的袖扣了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.24,0:13:30.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Has anybody seen my cufflinks?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:32.89,0:13:35.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所以你是丢了袖扣吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.89,0:13:35.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So you lost your cufflinks, eh?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:35.87,0:13:38.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,很有可能就在裤头村三角区
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.87,0:13:38.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,They're probably in the Bikini Bottom triangle
Dialogue: 1,0:13:38.50,0:13:40.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,裤头村三角区
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.50,0:13:40.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The Bikini Bottom triangle?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:40.42,0:13:41.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.42,0:13:41.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's right
Dialogue: 1,0:13:41.50,0:13:44.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,先有一股阴森的浓雾袭来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.50,0:13:44.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,First, an eerie fog rolls in
Dialogue: 1,0:13:49.51,0:13:53.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,然后美人鱼催眠的歌声传来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.51,0:13:53.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Then you can hear the hypnotic song of the mermaids
Dialogue: 1,0:13:56.97,0:13:58.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再然后  嘣
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.97,0:13:58.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And then, poof
Dialogue: 1,0:13:58.73,0:14:01.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你的袖扣消失了  再也回不来了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.73,0:14:01.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Your cufflinks are gone, never to return
Dialogue: 1,0:14:05.77,0:14:08.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一定是三角区带走了蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.77,0:14:08.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The triangle must have taken Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:14:08.07,0:14:08.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一定要找到他
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.07,0:14:08.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We got to find him
Dialogue: 1,0:14:08.95,0:14:12.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板可能一大早跳垃圾桶里
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.95,0:14:12.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Maybe Mr. Krabs is doing his morning dumpster dive
Dialogue: 1,0:14:12.13,0:14:13.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,翻零钱去了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.13,0:14:13.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,for loose change
Dialogue: 1,0:14:13.74,0:14:15.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板  你在外面吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.74,0:14:15.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs, are you out here?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:17.66,0:14:18.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不好了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.66,0:14:18.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, no
Dialogue: 1,0:14:18.67,0:14:20.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是美人鱼的歌声吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.67,0:14:20.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Is that a mermaid song?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:20.88,0:14:22.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不是  只是阴森的浓雾
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.88,0:14:22.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, just a thick eerie fog
Dialogue: 1,0:14:32.83,0:14:33.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.83,0:14:33.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:14:37.95,0:14:39.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快点  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.95,0:14:39.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:14:39.05,0:14:40.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别鬼混了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.05,0:14:40.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Quit messing around
Dialogue: 1,0:14:40.17,0:14:41.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一定要找到蟹老
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.17,0:14:41.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We got to find Mr. Kra--
Dialogue: 1,0:14:41.75,0:14:42.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有口香糖
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.75,0:14:42.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gumballs
Dialogue: 1,0:14:50.91,0:14:53.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这里就是裤头村三角区吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.91,0:14:53.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is the Bikini Bottom triangle?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:53.49,0:14:54.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看着更像是垃圾场吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.49,0:14:54.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Looks more like a dump
Dialogue: 1,0:14:54.95,0:14:57.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快点  一定要找到蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.95,0:14:57.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on, we got to find Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:14:57.02,0:14:58.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹堡王需要他
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.02,0:14:58.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The Krusty Krab needs him
Dialogue: 1,0:14:59.58,0:15:01.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.58,0:15:01.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:15:02.40,0:15:04.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥  没空胡闹了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.40,0:15:04.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward, this is no time for sea horseplay
Dialogue: 1,0:15:05.05,0:15:05.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的脖子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.05,0:15:05.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My neck
Dialogue: 1,0:15:05.58,0:15:07.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.58,0:15:07.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:07.31,0:15:12.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.31,0:15:12.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:15:12.00,0:15:14.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你能不能闭嘴啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.00,0:15:14.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Would you shut it already?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:14.49,0:15:17.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥  蟹老板不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.49,0:15:17.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, Squidward, Mr. Krabs is gone
Dialogue: 1,0:15:17.78,0:15:19.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,让我痛彻心扉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.78,0:15:19.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It hurts so bad
Dialogue: 1,0:15:19.50,0:15:21.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再也受不了了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.50,0:15:21.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can't take it much longer
Dialogue: 1,0:15:21.05,0:15:24.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不管他在哪  希望他没受苦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.05,0:15:24.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I hope he's not in any pain, wherever he is
Dialogue: 1,0:15:24.10,0:15:26.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我觉得他过得很好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.10,0:15:26.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I think he's doing just fine
Dialogue: 1,0:15:28.10,0:15:29.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板  快起来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.10,0:15:29.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs, you got to get up
Dialogue: 1,0:15:29.95,0:15:31.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们得离开这里
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.95,0:15:31.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We got to get out of here
Dialogue: 1,0:15:32.28,0:15:34.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蒂伯  差不多可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.28,0:15:34.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, Tibor, I think I'm good
Dialogue: 1,0:15:34.40,0:15:36.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别忘了多喝水
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.40,0:15:36.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Remember to drink plenty of fluids
Dialogue: 1,0:15:37.16,0:15:38.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,听着  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.16,0:15:38.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Look, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:15:38.03,0:15:40.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这一切  包括你和我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.03,0:15:40.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You see, all this stuff, including you and me
Dialogue: 1,0:15:40.65,0:15:43.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,都是美人鱼唱出天籁时被带来这的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.65,0:15:42.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,are brought here when the mermaids
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.33,0:15:43.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,sing their beautiful song
Dialogue: 1,0:15:44.03,0:15:46.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,美人鱼的歌声触发了这个装置
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.03,0:15:46.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The mermaid song triggers this here contraption
Dialogue: 1,0:15:46.67,0:15:49.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,让它像吸尘器一样吸天空
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.67,0:15:49.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to suck the sky like a vacuum
Dialogue: 1,0:15:49.00,0:15:52.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,把吸到的东西全倒上了这座岛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.00,0:15:52.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,dumping all the contents here on this island
Dialogue: 1,0:15:52.22,0:15:54.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就是这样  我们的四周
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.22,0:15:54.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That is how we ended up surrounded
Dialogue: 1,0:15:54.91,0:15:59.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,才有这么多能拿来倒卖的值钱货
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.91,0:15:59.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,by all this valuable and resellable stuff
Dialogue: 1,0:16:01.87,0:16:02.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.87,0:16:02.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yippee
Dialogue: 1,0:16:02.73,0:16:03.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,新一批货来了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.73,0:16:03.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A new shipment
Dialogue: 1,0:16:06.64,0:16:08.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,免费玩意  我来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.64,0:16:08.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Free stuff, here I
Dialogue: 1,0:16:08.68,0:16:09.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.68,0:16:09.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:14.75,0:16:16.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还不错吧  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.75,0:16:16.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Pretty neat, eh, boy?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:18.24,0:16:19.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.24,0:16:19.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:16:19.45,0:16:21.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,找到我袖扣了没
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.45,0:16:21.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Have you found my cufflinks?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:21.13,0:16:21.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.13,0:16:21.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:16:23.14,0:16:24.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  那是个蟹黄堡吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.14,0:16:24.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, is that a Krabby Patty?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:24.62,0:16:25.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.62,0:16:25.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yep
Dialogue: 1,0:16:25.75,0:16:28.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不过珍珍做的可没你那么好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.75,0:16:28.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Pearl doesn't make them as good as you do, though
Dialogue: 1,0:16:28.94,0:16:29.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,珍珍
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.94,0:16:29.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Pearl?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:31.12,0:16:32.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的宝贝女儿
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.12,0:16:32.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Me sweet little girl
Dialogue: 1,0:16:32.97,0:16:34.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,孤身一人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.97,0:16:34.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All alone
Dialogue: 1,0:16:34.30,0:16:36.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,跟我收银机待在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.30,0:16:36.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,With me cash register
Dialogue: 1,0:16:37.57,0:16:38.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,老爸
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.57,0:16:38.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Daddy
Dialogue: 1,0:16:39.27,0:16:40.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,珍珍
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.27,0:16:40.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Pearl
Dialogue: 1,0:16:42.00,0:16:44.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,带我离开这个垃圾堆
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.00,0:16:44.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Get me out of this trash heap
Dialogue: 1,0:16:47.32,0:16:48.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的小天使
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.32,0:16:48.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Me little angel
Dialogue: 1,0:16:48.82,0:16:51.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢谢神秘的歌唱美人鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.82,0:16:51.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thanks, mysterious singing mermaids
Dialogue: 1,0:16:52.67,0:16:54.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别再抱了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.67,0:16:54.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Enough with the hugging
Dialogue: 1,0:16:54.25,0:16:55.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有了  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.25,0:16:55.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's it, Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:16:55.28,0:16:57.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只要找到神秘的歌唱美人鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.28,0:16:57.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll just find the mysterious singing mermaids
Dialogue: 1,0:16:57.62,0:16:59.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,问她们怎么离开这就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.62,0:16:59.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and ask them how to get out of here
Dialogue: 1,0:17:04.71,0:17:07.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,被别人背着走好累啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.71,0:17:07.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Riding piggyback is exhausting
Dialogue: 1,0:17:07.36,0:17:08.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,确实
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.36,0:17:08.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're telling me
Dialogue: 1,0:17:12.55,0:17:14.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我爱这镜子  姐妹们
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.55,0:17:14.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I love this mirror, girls
Dialogue: 1,0:17:14.50,0:17:16.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可它都过时了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.50,0:17:16.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but it is so ten minutes ago
Dialogue: 1,0:17:17.31,0:17:19.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就是说  同意到不能再同意了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.31,0:17:19.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Like, I couldn't agree with you more
Dialogue: 1,0:17:19.32,0:17:21.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对啊  这堆玩意都老古董了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.32,0:17:21.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, like, all this stuff is old news
Dialogue: 1,0:17:22.24,0:17:23.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要来唱吗  姐妹们
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.24,0:17:23.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Shall we, ladies?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:27.48,0:17:28.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.48,0:17:28.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Excuse me
Dialogue: 1,0:17:29.61,0:17:30.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.61,0:17:30.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hi
Dialogue: 1,0:17:31.63,0:17:32.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有什么事要帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.63,0:17:32.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Can I help you?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:35.10,0:17:36.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有  美人鱼小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.10,0:17:36.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes, mermaid ladies
Dialogue: 1,0:17:36.17,0:17:37.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们可以帮我们忙
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.17,0:17:37.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,you actually can help us
Dialogue: 1,0:17:38.65,0:17:39.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.65,0:17:39.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:17:39.72,0:17:41.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们想知道怎么离开这  麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.72,0:17:41.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we'd like to know how to get out of here, please
Dialogue: 1,0:17:41.50,0:17:44.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就是说  这里可是裤头村三角区
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.50,0:17:44.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Like, this is the Bikini Bottom triangle
Dialogue: 1,0:17:44.35,0:17:45.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,从来没有东西离开过
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.35,0:17:45.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nothing ever leaves
Dialogue: 1,0:17:45.87,0:17:46.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还用说吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.87,0:17:46.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Duh
Dialogue: 1,0:17:46.62,0:17:47.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,确定吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.62,0:17:47.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:47.85,0:17:49.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,听好  小怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.85,0:17:49.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Look, little freakazoid
Dialogue: 1,0:17:49.37,0:17:50.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们只知道一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.37,0:17:50.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,we only know one thing
Dialogue: 1,0:17:51.07,0:17:54.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就是让我们四周都是酷酷的新东西
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.07,0:17:52.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and that's how to surround ourselves
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.67,0:17:54.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,with cool new stuff
Dialogue: 1,0:17:54.12,0:17:55.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看心情随时把它召唤过来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.12,0:17:55.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,whenever we feel like it
Dialogue: 1,0:17:56.19,0:17:59.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,除了那个之外的事全是完没关
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.19,0:17:59.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Anything beyond that is T.N.O.P.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:59.37,0:18:00.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,完没关
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.37,0:18:00.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Tnop?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:00.64,0:18:01.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,废话
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.64,0:18:01.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:18:01.55,0:18:04.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就是完全跟我们没有关系
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.55,0:18:04.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You know, totally not our problem
Dialogue: 1,0:18:04.66,0:18:06.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那个完没关啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.66,0:18:06.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, T.N.O.P.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:06.87,0:18:08.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还是谢谢你们了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.87,0:18:08.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, well, thanks anyway
Dialogue: 1,0:18:08.52,0:18:09.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.52,0:18:09.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on, Patrick, let's go
Dialogue: 1,0:18:10.00,0:18:10.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.00,0:18:10.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:18:13.37,0:18:14.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你先走吧  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.37,0:18:14.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You go ahead, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:18:15.56,0:18:18.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要跟几位小姐姐混一下
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.56,0:18:18.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna hang with the ladies for a bit
Dialogue: 1,0:18:21.90,0:18:22.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.90,0:18:22.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on
Dialogue: 1,0:18:22.64,0:18:23.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你一定在里面
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.64,0:18:23.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on, I know you're in there
Dialogue: 1,0:18:24.76,0:18:26.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,欲擒故纵是吧  小东西
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.76,0:18:26.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Playing hard to get, weren't you, little one?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.62,0:18:30.13,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(552,204)\fnArial}25{\fnAdobe 黑体 Std R}分
Dialogue: 1,0:18:26.99,0:18:27.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,敢叫我小东西
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.99,0:18:27.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Little one?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:27.98,0:18:29.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你好大的胆子  先生
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.98,0:18:29.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How dare you, sir?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:30.74,0:18:31.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,老板  我回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.74,0:18:31.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sir, I'm back
Dialogue: 1,0:18:32.17,0:18:34.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可惜我没办法从她们那打听到
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.17,0:18:33.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, I was unable
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.80,0:18:34.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to get the information from--
Dialogue: 1,0:18:36.09,0:18:37.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.09,0:18:37.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:39.56,0:18:40.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.56,0:18:40.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob, boy-o
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.47,0:18:44.60,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1218,830)}女生世界
Dialogue: 1,0:18:40.77,0:18:42.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  听得到我说话吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.77,0:18:42.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:42.25,0:18:43.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,应该去帮忙吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.25,0:18:43.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Should we help?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:43.25,0:18:44.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我觉得他样子没事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.25,0:18:44.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He looks fine to me
Dialogue: 1,0:18:44.62,0:18:46.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么回事  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.62,0:18:46.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, boy-o?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:46.84,0:18:49.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你的蟹黄堡燃料表空了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.84,0:18:49.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Your Krabby Patty meter's on empty
Dialogue: 1,0:18:49.46,0:18:51.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,得马上找个蟹黄堡喂你  不然就
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.46,0:18:51.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We got to get a Krabby Patty into you quick or--
Dialogue: 1,0:18:56.19,0:18:58.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,求你了  伟大的吸尘器
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.19,0:18:58.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Please, great vacuum cleaner
Dialogue: 1,0:18:58.64,0:19:00.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只要赐给我们一个小小的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.64,0:19:00.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,give us just one little
Dialogue: 1,0:19:06.82,0:19:08.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.82,0:19:08.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Krabby Patty
Dialogue: 1,0:19:18.35,0:19:21.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.35,0:19:21.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:19:21.67,0:19:22.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,老板
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.67,0:19:22.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sir
Dialogue: 1,0:19:22.02,0:19:24.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,刚刚那是我吃过最好吃的一个蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.02,0:19:24.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That was the single best Krabby Patty I have ever eaten
Dialogue: 1,0:19:24.57,0:19:25.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,多谢了  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.57,0:19:25.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why, thank you, boy-o
Dialogue: 1,0:19:25.90,0:19:26.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真高兴你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.90,0:19:26.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you--
Dialogue: 1,0:19:26.89,0:19:27.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等下
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.89,0:19:27.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute
Dialogue: 1,0:19:27.99,0:19:29.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那个蟹黄堡不是我做的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.99,0:19:29.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I didn't make that Krabby Patty
Dialogue: 1,0:19:29.64,0:19:31.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那个蟹黄堡也不是你做的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.64,0:19:31.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And you didn't make that Krabby Patty
Dialogue: 1,0:19:31.90,0:19:33.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那两个家伙不可能会做
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.90,0:19:33.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And those two couldn't have made it
Dialogue: 1,0:19:33.82,0:19:36.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所以一定是那个小烂人痞老板搞的鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.82,0:19:36.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,so it must have been that rotten pipsqueak, Plankton
Dialogue: 1,0:19:36.82,0:19:39.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,得去阻止那个低等生物小坏蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.82,0:19:39.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I got to stop that poor excuse of a life-form from--
Dialogue: 1,0:19:40.37,0:19:40.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.37,0:19:40.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So
Dialogue: 1,0:19:41.63,0:19:42.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要怎么离开这里
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.63,0:19:42.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How do we get out of here?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:42.82,0:19:44.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,老板  根据美人鱼先前告诉我的说法
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.82,0:19:44.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, sir, based on what the mermaids told me
Dialogue: 1,0:19:44.83,0:19:45.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,其实
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.83,0:19:45.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,there--
Dialogue: 1,0:19:45.39,0:19:46.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没有出口
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.39,0:19:46.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,there is no way out
Dialogue: 1,0:19:46.72,0:19:47.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.72,0:19:47.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:47.77,0:19:50.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,应该是你不懂怎么跟女的搭讪吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.77,0:19:50.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, I think you don't know how to talk to the ladies
Dialogue: 1,0:19:50.83,0:19:51.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,老板  我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.83,0:19:51.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, sir, I--
Dialogue: 1,0:19:51.89,0:19:52.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,听好  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.89,0:19:52.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Look, boy
Dialogue: 1,0:19:53.14,0:19:54.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我很会讨女孩欢心
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.14,0:19:54.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I got a way with the ladies
Dialogue: 1,0:19:54.67,0:19:57.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,而且我保证  老螃蟹的魅力
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.67,0:19:57.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And I guarantee the old Krabs charm
Dialogue: 1,0:19:57.31,0:20:00.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,肯定能引她们说出怎么离开这个地方
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.31,0:19:58.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,will have them telling us
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.38,0:20:00.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,exactly how to get out of this place
Dialogue: 1,0:20:01.35,0:20:03.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所以这地方真的没有出口吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.35,0:20:03.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So there's really no way out of this place?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:03.88,0:20:06.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我真的很需要回到蟹堡王
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.88,0:20:06.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,'cause I really need to get back to the Krusty Krab
Dialogue: 1,0:20:06.49,0:20:09.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,阻止我的死对头毁了我的生意
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.49,0:20:09.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and stop my archnemesis from ruining me business
Dialogue: 1,0:20:10.09,0:20:12.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,完没关  老大爷
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.09,0:20:12.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,T.N.O.P., grandpa
Dialogue: 1,0:20:12.23,0:20:13.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,完没关
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.23,0:20:13.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Tnop?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:13.50,0:20:14.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,完全跟我们没有关系
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.50,0:20:14.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Totally not our problem
Dialogue: 1,0:20:15.02,0:20:18.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,附注  让你们的粉红怪朋友滚回去
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.02,0:20:18.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And P.S., here's your creepy pink friend back
Dialogue: 1,0:20:19.47,0:20:20.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,老爸
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.47,0:20:20.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Daddy
Dialogue: 1,0:20:20.35,0:20:21.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,老爸
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.35,0:20:21.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Daddy
Dialogue: 1,0:20:21.22,0:20:22.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,放心  珍珍
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.22,0:20:22.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Pearl
Dialogue: 1,0:20:22.46,0:20:23.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,老爸没事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.46,0:20:23.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Daddy's okay
Dialogue: 1,0:20:23.56,0:20:25.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我能去商场了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.56,0:20:25.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Can I go to the mall now?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:25.28,0:20:26.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,商场吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.28,0:20:26.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The mall?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:26.42,0:20:27.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可是珍珍
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.42,0:20:27.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But, Pearl--
Dialogue: 1,0:20:27.24,0:20:29.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要去商场
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.24,0:20:29.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I want to go to the mall
Dialogue: 1,0:20:31.97,0:20:32.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,商场是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.97,0:20:32.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Like, what's a mall?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:34.46,0:20:34.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.46,0:20:34.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait
Dialogue: 1,0:20:34.82,0:20:35.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.82,0:20:35.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:35.50,0:20:37.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们当真不知道商场是什么吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.50,0:20:37.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You seriously don't know what a mall is?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:38.15,0:20:39.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我当真当真
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.15,0:20:39.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm seriously serious
Dialogue: 1,0:20:40.12,0:20:43.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这个商场呢  是最最一级棒的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.12,0:20:43.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, the mall is, like, only the most awesome place
Dialogue: 1,0:20:43.38,0:20:45.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大家可以在里面买到最棒  超酷
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.38,0:20:45.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to get all the best, super coolest
Dialogue: 1,0:20:45.59,0:20:48.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,闪闪发亮的新奇好东西  要啥都有
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.59,0:20:48.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,glitterishly fabulous new stuff you want
Dialogue: 1,0:20:48.86,0:20:49.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.86,0:20:49.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:49.37,0:20:50.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.37,0:20:50.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No way
Dialogue: 1,0:20:50.31,0:20:52.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们想去商场
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.31,0:20:52.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We want to go to the mall
Dialogue: 1,0:20:53.11,0:20:53.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.11,0:20:53.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Do you?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:55.17,0:20:58.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那要怎么一个去法
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.17,0:20:58.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, how do you propose we do that, huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:59.05,0:20:59.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.05,0:20:59.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait
Dialogue: 1,0:20:59.69,0:21:00.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.69,0:21:00.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I know
Dialogue: 1,0:21:00.70,0:21:04.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,按这巨大吸尘器的神奇倒转按钮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.70,0:21:02.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We just hit the magic reverse button
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.86,0:21:04.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,on the giant vacuum cleaner
Dialogue: 1,0:21:05.08,0:21:05.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有了  老板
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.08,0:21:05.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's it, sir
Dialogue: 1,0:21:05.92,0:21:07.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,按钮就是美人鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.92,0:21:07.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's the mermaids
Dialogue: 1,0:21:07.61,0:21:08.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好一个
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.61,0:21:08.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It sure is--
Dialogue: 1,0:21:08.62,0:21:08.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.62,0:21:08.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,what?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:08.88,0:21:10.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,倒转开关就是美人鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.88,0:21:10.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The reverse switch is the mermaids
Dialogue: 1,0:21:10.92,0:21:13.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只要让她们倒着唱歌就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.92,0:21:13.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,They just need to sing their song backwards
Dialogue: 1,0:21:14.00,0:21:14.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.00,0:21:14.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:21:14.90,0:21:15.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,倒着唱
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.90,0:21:15.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Backwards
Dialogue: 1,0:21:19.52,0:21:21.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对对对  倒着唱
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.52,0:21:21.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, backwards
Dialogue: 1,0:21:21.10,0:21:23.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好个馊主意
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.10,0:21:23.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What a stupid idea
Dialogue: 1,0:21:41.83,0:21:44.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,准备好去商场没  姐妹们
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.83,0:21:44.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You ready for the mall, girls?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:44.12,0:21:45.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.12,0:21:45.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:21:45.63,0:21:47.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,商场
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.63,0:21:47.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mall
Dialogue: 1,0:21:48.53,0:21:50.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你好  悲苦一生
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.53,0:21:50.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hello, miserable life
Dialogue: 1,0:21:50.43,0:21:51.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.43,0:21:51.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm back
Dialogue: 1,0:21:52.68,0:21:53.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的假牙也回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.68,0:21:53.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And so are my dentures
Dialogue: 1,0:21:56.41,0:21:59.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蒂伯  你还活着
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.41,0:21:59.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Tibor, you're alive
Dialogue: 1,0:21:59.00,0:22:00.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是不是很棒啊  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.00,0:22:00.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Isn't it great, Mr. Krabs?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:00.65,0:22:02.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所有东西都物归原主了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.65,0:22:02.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Everyone's reclaiming their stuff
Dialogue: 1,0:22:03.02,0:22:03.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.02,0:22:03.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:04.02,0:22:05.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,说到物归原主
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.02,0:22:05.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Speaking of reclaiming
Dialogue: 1,0:22:06.24,0:22:09.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,痞老板  我知道你有什么把戏
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.24,0:22:09.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All right, plankton, I know what you're up to
Dialogue: 1,0:22:09.08,0:22:11.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但是早就露馅了  你这狡诈的小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.08,0:22:11.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But the jig's up, you little conniving pipsqueak
Dialogue: 1,0:22:13.65,0:22:15.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,其实我叫查尔斯
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.65,0:22:15.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Actually, the name's Charles
Dialogue: 1,0:22:15.87,0:22:18.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,打算在你消失的时候帮忙看下店
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.87,0:22:17.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I figured I'd hold down the fort for you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.64,0:22:18.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,while you were gone
Dialogue: 1,0:22:18.71,0:22:21.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,原来做蟹黄堡的一直都是你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.71,0:22:21.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So you've been the one making Krabby Patties?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:21.64,0:22:22.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.64,0:22:22.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yup
Dialogue: 1,0:22:22.16,0:22:22.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一直是我
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.16,0:22:22.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All me
Dialogue: 1,0:22:23.49,0:22:26.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,顺带一提  你们这边闹害虫
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.49,0:22:26.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And by the way, you've got a little vermin problem
Dialogue: 1,0:22:27.01,0:22:27.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,说谁害虫
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.01,0:22:27.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Vermin?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:27.80,0:22:28.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,把话收回去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.80,0:22:28.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You take that back
Dialogue: 1,0:22:29.11,0:22:30.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,脾气还挺大
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.11,0:22:30.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He's a feisty one
Dialogue: 1,0:22:32.85,0:22:35.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,找到我的袖扣了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.85,0:22:35.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I found my cufflinks
Dialogue: 1,0:22:36.91,0:22:38.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好多了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.91,0:22:38.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's better
Dialogue: 1,0:22:38.50,0:22:39.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再见  先生们
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.50,0:22:39.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good day, gentlemen
Dialogue: 1,0:22:43.85,0:22:44.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,回家吧  雷金纳德
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.85,0:22:44.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Home, Reginald
Dialogue: 1,0:22:48.76,0:22:50.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  你晚礼服上的腰封掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.76,0:22:50.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, you dropped your cummerbund
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.01,0:22:53.14,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(766,706)}裤头村传说
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.39,0:22:57.85,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(738,860)}总排水管
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.93,0:22:59.23,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz27.52\pos(240,448)}分镜总监
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.93,0:23:00.52,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1096,976.667)}翻译{\fnArial}: 1440kHz
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.93,0:22:59.23,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz27.52\pos(480,710)}编剧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.27,0:23:00.52,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.51\pos(404,444)}创意总监
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.27,0:23:00.52,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.51\pos(524,690)}动画总监
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.56,0:23:02.02,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.51\pos(432,530)}制片指导
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.56,0:23:02.02,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1034.667,976.667)}本字幕仅限学习交流\N严禁用于商业用途
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.06,0:23:05.02,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(414,486)}蟹堡王
Dialogue: 1,0:23:10.49,0:23:12.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,新鲜的冷冻蟹黄堡肉饼最好了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.49,0:23:12.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nothing like a fresh frozen Krabby Patty
Dialogue: 1,0:23:12.62,0:23:14.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,它还有着加倍的冻硬风味
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.62,0:23:14.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,with extra freezer burn flavor
Dialogue: 1,0:23:18.79,0:23:19.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.79,0:23:19.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Here we go--
Dialogue: 1,0:23:25.59,0:23:26.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,烤架看着有点脏
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.59,0:23:26.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Grill looks a tad dirty
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.84,0:23:30.80,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(230,236)}此处点餐
Dialogue: 1,0:23:27.05,0:23:28.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好  我想点
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.05,0:23:28.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'd like to order--
Dialogue: 1,0:23:29.92,0:23:30.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你先慢着
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.92,0:23:30.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hold that thought
Dialogue: 1,0:23:32.14,0:23:34.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  吵什么吵
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.14,0:23:34.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob, what's all the racket?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:38.14,0:23:39.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所以我想点
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.14,0:23:39.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So I'd like to order--
Dialogue: 1,0:23:49.78,0:23:50.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,话说
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.78,0:23:50.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Say
Dialogue: 1,0:23:50.36,0:23:51.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谁要吃
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.36,0:23:51.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Who wants
Dialogue: 1,0:23:51.86,0:23:55.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,用刚清过的烤架做的第一个蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.86,0:23:55.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,the first patty from our freshly cleaned grill?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:58.49,0:23:59.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要来份蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.49,0:23:59.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I would like a Krabby Patty
Dialogue: 1,0:23:59.83,0:24:00.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.83,0:24:00.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 1,0:24:00.75,0:24:01.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那你呢  章
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.75,0:24:01.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How about you, Squid--
Dialogue: 1,0:24:01.41,0:24:03.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不要蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.41,0:24:03.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, I do not want a Krabby Patty
Dialogue: 1,0:24:03.71,0:24:05.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你确定吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.71,0:24:05.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You sure?
Dialogue: 1,0:24:06.00,0:24:06.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别碰我
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.00,0:24:06.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't touch me
Dialogue: 1,0:24:06.71,0:24:08.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你为什么不要蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.71,0:24:08.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why don't you want a Krabby Patty?
Dialogue: 1,0:24:08.30,0:24:10.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我看过他清理烤架用的工具
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.30,0:24:10.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've seen what he cleans the grill with
Dialogue: 1,0:24:10.30,0:24:12.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,万事俱备  只欠新鲜肉饼
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.30,0:24:12.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now all I need is a fresh patty
Dialogue: 1,0:24:26.56,0:24:27.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这么多水哪来的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.56,0:24:27.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where'd all this water come from?
Dialogue: 1,0:24:30.69,0:24:31.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.69,0:24:31.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There we go
Dialogue: 1,0:24:31.69,0:24:33.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.69,0:24:33.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, my stars and garters
Dialogue: 1,0:24:33.57,0:24:34.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,水槽堵住了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.57,0:24:34.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,the sink is clogged up
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.95,0:24:35.66,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(578,692)}危险
Dialogue: 1,0:24:36.28,0:24:37.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,安全
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.28,0:24:37.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Safety
Dialogue: 1,0:24:39.29,0:24:41.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,出了什么问题
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.29,0:24:41.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, what seems to be the trouble, hmm?
Dialogue: 1,0:24:43.08,0:24:44.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.08,0:24:44.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, what happened?
Dialogue: 1,0:24:44.50,0:24:46.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我本来走在路上
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.50,0:24:46.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There I was, walking along
Dialogue: 1,0:24:46.79,0:24:49.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,专注着自己的事  然后
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.79,0:24:49.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,just minding my own business, and then
Dialogue: 1,0:24:49.59,0:24:50.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,砰
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.59,0:24:50.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,boom
Dialogue: 1,0:24:50.51,0:24:53.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有个傻子把这东西放路上
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.51,0:24:53.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Some dumbbell put this thing in the way
Dialogue: 1,0:24:54.55,0:24:55.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.55,0:24:55.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What you doing?
Dialogue: 1,0:24:55.89,0:24:57.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,想看看水槽是什么东西堵的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.89,0:24:57.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Trying to see what has this sink all backed up
Dialogue: 1,0:24:57.93,0:24:59.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可以先失陪一下吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.93,0:24:59.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Would you excuse me a second?
Dialogue: 1,0:25:06.35,0:25:07.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这就简单了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.35,0:25:07.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is easy
Dialogue: 1,0:25:07.36,0:25:08.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只要拔掉排水管塞
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.36,0:25:08.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All I have to do is pull the drain plug
Dialogue: 1,0:25:08.86,0:25:10.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,拔掉排水管塞
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.86,0:25:10.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Pull the drain plug
Dialogue: 1,0:25:10.15,0:25:11.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,拔掉排水管塞
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.15,0:25:11.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Pull the drain plug
Dialogue: 1,0:25:11.44,0:25:12.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,拔掉排水管塞
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.44,0:25:12.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Pull the drain plug
Dialogue: 1,0:25:12.74,0:25:13.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,排水管塞
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.74,0:25:13.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The drain plug
Dialogue: 1,0:25:13.61,0:25:14.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,排水管塞
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.61,0:25:14.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The drain plug
Dialogue: 1,0:25:14.70,0:25:15.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,排水管塞
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.70,0:25:15.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The drain plug
Dialogue: 1,0:25:15.86,0:25:16.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,排水管塞
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.86,0:25:16.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The drain plug
Dialogue: 1,0:25:16.86,0:25:18.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,排水管塞
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.86,0:25:18.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The drain plug?
Dialogue: 1,0:25:21.16,0:25:22.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.16,0:25:22.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:25:24.75,0:25:27.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你到底是想干什么  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.75,0:25:27.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What in Neptune's bathtub do you think you're doing, lad?
Dialogue: 1,0:25:27.63,0:25:28.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,水槽堵住了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.63,0:25:28.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, the sink is clogged
Dialogue: 1,0:25:28.88,0:25:30.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所以我就想拔了排水管塞
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.88,0:25:30.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,so I was gonna pull out the drain plug
Dialogue: 1,0:25:30.63,0:25:33.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别乱动那个排水管塞
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.63,0:25:33.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Stop messing with that drain plug
Dialogue: 1,0:25:33.38,0:25:34.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你傻吗
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.38,0:25:34.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Are you daft?
Dialogue: 1,0:25:34.42,0:25:36.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,为什么不让我拔掉排水管塞  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.42,0:25:36.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why don't you want me to pull the drain plug, Mr. Krabs?
Dialogue: 1,0:25:36.84,0:25:37.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,为什么不
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.84,0:25:37.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why don't I--
Dialogue: 1,0:25:39.60,0:25:40.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.60,0:25:40.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,One sec
Dialogue: 1,0:25:42.81,0:25:45.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在来讲个恐怖故事
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.81,0:25:45.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Time for a scary story, boys
Dialogue: 1,0:25:46.19,0:25:51.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,总排水管的故事
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.19,0:25:51.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The story of the main drain
Dialogue: 1,0:25:53.19,0:25:53.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.19,0:25:53.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:25:53.86,0:25:54.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.86,0:25:54.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry
Dialogue: 1,0:25:55.11,0:25:55.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我刚刚说到
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.11,0:25:55.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,As I was saying
Dialogue: 1,0:25:56.57,0:25:58.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,故事发生在很久以前
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.57,0:25:58.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,it happened a long time ago
Dialogue: 1,0:26:01.16,0:26:01.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.16,0:26:01.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:26:02.91,0:26:05.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,主角是一对小孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.91,0:26:05.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,To a pair of little kids
Dialogue: 1,0:26:06.46,0:26:07.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,两个小孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.46,0:26:07.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Two little kids?
Dialogue: 1,0:26:09.25,0:26:12.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,总之  据说总排水管
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.25,0:26:12.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Anyway, it's said that the main drain
Dialogue: 1,0:26:12.38,0:26:14.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,诱惑了他们
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.38,0:26:14.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,beckoned to them
Dialogue: 1,0:26:14.34,0:26:16.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,让他们无法自拔
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.34,0:26:16.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,putting them under its spell
Dialogue: 1,0:26:22.26,0:26:24.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有一天  那两个小孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.26,0:26:24.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,One day, those two kids
Dialogue: 1,0:26:24.56,0:26:26.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,在海里四处乱跑
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.56,0:26:26.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,were wandering through the ocean
Dialogue: 1,0:26:26.52,0:26:28.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,偶然间发现了它
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.52,0:26:28.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,when they stumbled upon it
Dialogue: 1,0:26:30.15,0:26:33.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,总排水管
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.15,0:26:33.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The main drain
Dialogue: 1,0:26:37.11,0:26:39.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,传说他们过分好奇
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.11,0:26:39.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Legend has it that their curiosity got the best of them
Dialogue: 1,0:26:40.82,0:26:42.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,于是拔掉了塞子
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.82,0:26:42.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And they pulled the plug
Dialogue: 1,0:26:42.99,0:26:45.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,整座海洋都迅速流进了排水管
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.99,0:26:45.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The entire ocean rushed into the drain
Dialogue: 1,0:26:45.45,0:26:50.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,把那两个小孩子也一同吸了进去
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.45,0:26:50.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and sucked those two kids right down with it
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.29,0:26:51.29,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1042,882)}裤头村
Dialogue: 1,0:26:50.29,0:26:52.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,排水管的吸力十分强大
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.29,0:26:52.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The drain was so powerful
Dialogue: 1,0:26:52.96,0:26:55.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,它的血盆大口吞噬了整个裤头村
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.96,0:26:55.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,it pulled all of Bikini Bottom into its gaping maw
Dialogue: 1,0:26:56.13,0:26:58.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,整座海洋陷入末日
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.13,0:26:58.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,causing an apocalypse of the sea
Dialogue: 1,0:27:02.64,0:27:08.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,从此音讯全无
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.64,0:27:08.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And nobody was ever heard from again
Dialogue: 1,0:27:08.85,0:27:10.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,总排水管在哪  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.85,0:27:10.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where is the main drain, Mr. Krabs?
Dialogue: 1,0:27:10.98,0:27:11.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就在
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.98,0:27:11.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, it's right--
Dialogue: 1,0:27:12.65,0:27:14.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不知道在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.65,0:27:14.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't know where it is
Dialogue: 1,0:27:14.57,0:27:15.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,而且也不可能告诉你们
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.57,0:27:15.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And I'm sure not gonna tell you
Dialogue: 1,0:27:16.40,0:27:17.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所以
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.40,0:27:17.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So--
Dialogue: 1,0:27:17.15,0:27:18.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所以快出去
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.15,0:27:18.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,so get out of here
Dialogue: 1,0:27:18.07,0:27:19.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不准靠近那个排水管
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.07,0:27:19.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And stay away from that drain
Dialogue: 1,0:27:19.95,0:27:22.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有我在就不准拔掉塞子
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.95,0:27:22.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No plugs will be pulled on my watch
Dialogue: 1,0:27:23.66,0:27:27.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板对排水管有好多心理包袱啊
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.66,0:27:27.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs sure has a lot of baggage about drain dealies
Dialogue: 1,0:27:27.75,0:27:31.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,总排水管听起来好像非常非常危险
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.75,0:27:31.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The main drain sounds very, very dangerous
Dialogue: 1,0:27:31.04,0:27:33.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我绝对不会去靠近的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.04,0:27:33.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm never gonna go near that thing
Dialogue: 1,0:27:33.25,0:27:34.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,应该去找它
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.25,0:27:34.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We should go find it
Dialogue: 1,0:27:34.92,0:27:37.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,保护它  阻止我们这样的好奇鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.92,0:27:37.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,To protect it from people like us
Dialogue: 1,0:27:37.63,0:27:40.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要是跟那两个小孩子一样被吸进去呢
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.63,0:27:40.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What if we get sucked in like those other two kids?
Dialogue: 1,0:27:40.63,0:27:41.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,放心
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.63,0:27:41.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't worry
Dialogue: 1,0:27:41.59,0:27:43.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们不是小孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.59,0:27:43.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're not little kids
Dialogue: 1,0:27:43.05,0:27:44.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们已经长大了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.05,0:27:44.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're all grown up
Dialogue: 1,0:27:49.18,0:27:50.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有颗乳牙
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.18,0:27:50.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A baby tooth
Dialogue: 1,0:27:51.02,0:27:55.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谁住裤头村的时间跟蟹老板一样久呢
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.02,0:27:55.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Who's been in Bikini Bottom for as long as Mr. Krabs?
Dialogue: 1,0:27:57.69,0:27:59.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,嗨  痞老板
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.69,0:27:59.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hi, Plankton
Dialogue: 1,0:28:01.99,0:28:03.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,问痞老板吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.99,0:28:03.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's ask Plankton
Dialogue: 1,0:28:03.16,0:28:03.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他是个怪老头
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.16,0:28:03.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He's a geezer
Dialogue: 1,0:28:03.95,0:28:07.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们想问什么傻问题  白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.95,0:28:07.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What stupid question do you want the answer to, idiots?
Dialogue: 1,0:28:07.70,0:28:09.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我跟派大星想找总排水管
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.70,0:28:09.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick and I are trying to find the main drain
Dialogue: 1,0:28:10.75,0:28:12.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,总排水管
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.75,0:28:12.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The main drain?
Dialogue: 1,0:28:13.33,0:28:15.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们两个干嘛来麻烦我
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.33,0:28:15.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What are you two bothering me for?
Dialogue: 1,0:28:15.38,0:28:16.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我是说  我
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.38,0:28:16.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I mean, I--
Dialogue: 1,0:28:16.09,0:28:18.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不知道总排水管在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.09,0:28:18.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't know where the main drain is
Dialogue: 1,0:28:18.05,0:28:19.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,反正就是个传说
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.05,0:28:19.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's a myth anyway
Dialogue: 1,0:28:19.09,0:28:20.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,根本没这回事
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.09,0:28:20.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It doesn't exist
Dialogue: 1,0:28:20.34,0:28:21.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对啊  可是蟹老板说
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.34,0:28:21.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but Mr. Krabs says--
Dialogue: 1,0:28:21.55,0:28:22.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,老螃蟹
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.55,0:28:22.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:28:22.26,0:28:22.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.26,0:28:22.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why, that--
Dialogue: 1,0:28:23.22,0:28:25.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他那是在跟你们瞎扯淡
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.22,0:28:25.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He was just telling you a fish tale
Dialogue: 1,0:28:25.05,0:28:28.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,根本就没有什么海底排水管
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.05,0:28:28.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There's no such thing as a drain at the bottom of the sea
Dialogue: 1,0:28:28.43,0:28:29.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快给我走
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.43,0:28:29.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So go on
Dialogue: 1,0:28:29.10,0:28:29.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,滚
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.10,0:28:29.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Scram
Dialogue: 1,0:28:29.72,0:28:30.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,去
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.72,0:28:30.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Shoo
Dialogue: 1,0:28:30.27,0:28:31.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,赶紧滚开
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.27,0:28:31.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Get out of here
Dialogue: 1,0:28:32.60,0:28:36.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,老螃蟹干嘛要跟那两个闯祸精
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.60,0:28:36.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why on earth would Krabs tell those two blunderers
Dialogue: 1,0:28:36.06,0:28:37.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,说总排水管的事
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.06,0:28:37.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,about the main drain?
Dialogue: 1,0:28:38.61,0:28:41.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不知道还有谁知道总排水管的事
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.61,0:28:41.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I wonder who else knows about the main drain
Dialogue: 1,0:28:44.61,0:28:46.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,老头简金斯
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.61,0:28:46.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Old man Jenkins
Dialogue: 1,0:28:46.70,0:28:50.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们两个为什么要问总排水管的事
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.70,0:28:50.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why are you two asking about the main drain?
Dialogue: 1,0:28:50.49,0:28:52.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板跟我们讲了个故事
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.49,0:28:52.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs told us a story
Dialogue: 1,0:28:52.16,0:28:54.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,说总排水管一度毁灭了裤头村
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.16,0:28:54.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,of how the main drain once destroyed Bikini Bottom
Dialogue: 1,0:28:54.96,0:28:56.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所以我们就一直在找它
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.96,0:28:56.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So we've been looking for it
Dialogue: 1,0:28:56.38,0:28:58.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真的有总排水管吗
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.38,0:28:58.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Does the main drain even exist?
Dialogue: 1,0:28:59.67,0:29:01.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,当然有了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.67,0:29:01.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It exists, all right
Dialogue: 1,0:29:01.42,0:29:02.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但是它被
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.42,0:29:02.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But it's been
Dialogue: 1,0:29:03.67,0:29:05.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,隐瞒了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.67,0:29:05.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hushed up
Dialogue: 1,0:29:05.43,0:29:09.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,排水管在何方  智者简金斯
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.43,0:29:09.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where is the drain, o wise Jenkins?
Dialogue: 1,0:29:09.60,0:29:10.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.60,0:29:10.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I have no idea
Dialogue: 1,0:29:14.60,0:29:15.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.60,0:29:15.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:29:15.44,0:29:17.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一定要找到那个排水管
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.44,0:29:17.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We need to find that drain
Dialogue: 1,0:29:17.48,0:29:18.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.48,0:29:18.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 1,0:29:18.40,0:29:20.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你就不好奇吗
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.40,0:29:20.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Isn't your curiosity piqued?
Dialogue: 1,0:29:20.73,0:29:22.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,万一有谁不小心拔了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.73,0:29:22.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What if somebody accidentally pulls it?
Dialogue: 1,0:29:22.32,0:29:23.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,万一
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.32,0:29:23.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What if--
Dialogue: 1,0:29:23.40,0:29:23.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,万一
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.40,0:29:23.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What if--
Dialogue: 1,0:29:23.90,0:29:24.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,吧啦吧啦吧啦
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.90,0:29:24.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,blah, blah, blah--
Dialogue: 1,0:29:24.78,0:29:28.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,天啊  希望他后面的问题不是要问我
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.78,0:29:28.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, I hope this question's not for me
Dialogue: 1,0:29:28.32,0:29:29.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我讨厌问题
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.32,0:29:29.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I hate questions
Dialogue: 1,0:29:31.08,0:29:31.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你说呢  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.08,0:29:31.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What do you think, Patrick?
Dialogue: 1,0:29:33.45,0:29:34.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,42
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.45,0:29:34.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,42
Dialogue: 1,0:29:34.96,0:29:35.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不对
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.96,0:29:35.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:29:35.50,0:29:36.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,三角形
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.50,0:29:36.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Triangle
Dialogue: 1,0:29:36.79,0:29:37.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,肉丸
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.79,0:29:37.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Meatballs
Dialogue: 1,0:29:37.96,0:29:38.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,螺丝刀
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.96,0:29:38.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Screwdrivers
Dialogue: 1,0:29:38.83,0:29:39.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,睡衣
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.83,0:29:39.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Pajamas
Dialogue: 1,0:29:41.09,0:29:42.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我听到了  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.09,0:29:42.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I hear you, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:29:42.21,0:29:43.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一起去找总排水管吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.21,0:29:43.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's go find that main drain
Dialogue: 1,0:29:43.92,0:29:44.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.92,0:29:44.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 1,0:29:48.22,0:29:49.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.22,0:29:49.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's start walking
Dialogue: 1,0:29:50.89,0:29:51.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不用了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.89,0:29:51.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, thanks
Dialogue: 1,0:29:51.89,0:29:55.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不是很喜欢走路
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.89,0:29:55.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm not into the whole walking thing
Dialogue: 1,0:29:55.68,0:29:56.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可是派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.68,0:29:56.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:29:56.69,0:29:58.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不走路还怎么到海洋正中央
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.69,0:29:58.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,how are we gonna get to the center of the ocean?
Dialogue: 1,0:29:58.73,0:29:59.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等着它过来这边就行
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.73,0:29:59.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We'll wait for it to come to us
Dialogue: 1,0:30:01.19,0:30:02.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我有个更好的办法
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.19,0:30:02.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I have a better idea
Dialogue: 1,0:30:15.29,0:30:16.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你觉得怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.29,0:30:16.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, what do you think?
Dialogue: 1,0:30:16.58,0:30:17.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.58,0:30:17.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I love it
Dialogue: 1,0:30:20.88,0:30:22.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,公路旅行
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.88,0:30:22.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Road trip
Dialogue: 1,0:30:26.26,0:30:27.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这办法不行
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.26,0:30:27.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, that's out
Dialogue: 1,0:30:29.05,0:30:29.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.05,0:30:29.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I know
Dialogue: 1,0:30:57.16,0:30:59.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,又是可悲的一天
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.16,0:30:59.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Another miserable day
Dialogue: 1,0:31:07.26,0:31:10.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这下要怎么找到海洋正中央
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.26,0:31:10.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How are we gonna find the center of the ocean now?
Dialogue: 1,0:31:13.30,0:31:15.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我知道该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.30,0:31:15.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I know exactly what to do
Dialogue: 1,0:31:29.90,0:31:30.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这样好多了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.90,0:31:30.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's better
Dialogue: 1,0:31:34.66,0:31:35.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,太棒了  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.66,0:31:35.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Doing great, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:31:35.95,0:31:37.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一下子就可以到了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.95,0:31:37.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We'll be there in no time
Dialogue: 1,0:31:41.54,0:31:43.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.54,0:31:43.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I found it
Dialogue: 1,0:31:43.83,0:31:44.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,干得漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.83,0:31:44.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good job
Dialogue: 1,0:31:45.29,0:31:46.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,拔出来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.29,0:31:46.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's pull it
Dialogue: 1,0:31:46.13,0:31:46.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.13,0:31:46.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:31:47.13,0:31:48.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,干嘛要那样
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.13,0:31:48.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why would we do that?
Dialogue: 1,0:31:48.38,0:31:50.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大老远过来就是要拔掉它  对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.38,0:31:50.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, that was the whole point of coming here, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 1,0:31:50.67,0:31:51.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不对
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.67,0:31:51.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:31:51.59,0:31:53.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是要来确认是不是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.59,0:31:53.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We came to see if it was real
Dialogue: 1,0:31:53.80,0:31:55.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那又怎么确定这不是假的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.80,0:31:55.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, how do we know this isn't a fake?
Dialogue: 1,0:31:56.14,0:31:56.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.14,0:31:56.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We--
Dialogue: 1,0:31:57.56,0:31:58.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.56,0:31:58.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We don't know
Dialogue: 1,0:31:58.85,0:32:00.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,拔了就知道
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.85,0:32:00.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We won't know unless we pull it
Dialogue: 1,0:32:00.73,0:32:03.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可要是拔完发现是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.73,0:32:03.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But if we pull it and if it's real
Dialogue: 1,0:32:03.90,0:32:05.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,世界可能就要毁灭了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.90,0:32:05.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,the world may end
Dialogue: 1,0:32:05.19,0:32:06.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要是不拔
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.19,0:32:06.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And if we don't
Dialogue: 1,0:32:06.73,0:32:08.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就不知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.73,0:32:08.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,we'll never know
Dialogue: 1,0:32:13.32,0:32:15.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.32,0:32:15.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:32:16.87,0:32:20.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小子  排水管的故事还有一点没讲
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.87,0:32:20.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Boys, there's more to that story about the drain
Dialogue: 1,0:32:20.37,0:32:21.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,跟你们说
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.37,0:32:21.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You see--
Dialogue: 1,0:32:21.37,0:32:24.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们就是那两个拔塞子的白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.37,0:32:24.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We were the two ding-a-lings who pulled that plug
Dialogue: 1,0:32:25.54,0:32:26.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.54,0:32:26.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's right
Dialogue: 1,0:32:26.46,0:32:30.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有一天  我跟痞老板在四处乱跑
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.46,0:32:30.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,One day, Plankton and I were wandering around
Dialogue: 1,0:32:59.16,0:33:02.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,知道了吧  我们不得不说谎
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.16,0:33:02.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You see, we had to lie
Dialogue: 1,0:33:02.45,0:33:04.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,才能阻止你们去找它
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.45,0:33:04.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to keep you from looking for it
Dialogue: 1,0:33:04.58,0:33:08.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们只是不想让你们重蹈我们的覆辙
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.58,0:33:08.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We just didn't want you to make the same mistake we made
Dialogue: 1,0:33:10.13,0:33:12.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真是好险啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.13,0:33:12.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That was a close one
Dialogue: 1,0:33:12.30,0:33:13.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.30,0:33:13.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:33:13.67,0:33:16.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,差点就让我们搞砸了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.67,0:33:16.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We almost messed up big-time
Dialogue: 1,0:33:43.20,0:33:47.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真是我听过最逼真的故事了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.20,0:33:47.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's the most realistic story I've ever heard
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.17,0:33:50.29,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(766,706)}裤头村传说
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.13,0:33:54.97,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(724,812)}深海乡巴佬
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.09,0:33:56.05,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz27.52\pos(278,456)}分镜总监
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.09,0:33:58.09,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1096,976.667)}翻译{\fnArial}: 1440kHz
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.09,0:33:56.05,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz27.52\pos(480,710)}编剧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.13,0:33:57.09,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.51\pos(386,418)}创意总监
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.13,0:33:57.09,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.51\pos(514,662)}动画总监
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.18,0:33:58.09,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.51\pos(432,530)}制片指导
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.18,0:33:59.18,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.51\pos(444,540)}客串
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.18,0:33:59.18,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1034.667,976.667)}本字幕仅限学习交流\N严禁用于商业用途
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.22,0:34:00.72,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(632,598)}水母田
Dialogue: 1,0:34:02.97,0:34:04.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看到它了没
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.97,0:34:04.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,See him?
Dialogue: 1,0:34:04.02,0:34:04.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.02,0:34:04.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nope
Dialogue: 1,0:34:06.31,0:34:06.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等下
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.31,0:34:06.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait
Dialogue: 1,0:34:06.81,0:34:07.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在看到了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.81,0:34:07.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now I do
Dialogue: 1,0:34:13.78,0:34:14.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,它在干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.78,0:34:14.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's he doing?
Dialogue: 1,0:34:16.24,0:34:17.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,貌似在那一动不动
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.24,0:34:17.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just kind of sitting there
Dialogue: 1,0:34:18.16,0:34:19.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在呢
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.16,0:34:19.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How about now?
Dialogue: 1,0:34:19.91,0:34:21.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还是貌似一动不动
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.91,0:34:21.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Still just kind of, like, sitting there
Dialogue: 1,0:34:21.41,0:34:22.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没变
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.41,0:34:22.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,same thing
Dialogue: 1,0:34:22.03,0:34:23.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们看多久了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.03,0:34:23.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How long have we been watching?
Dialogue: 1,0:34:23.79,0:34:24.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在几点了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.79,0:34:24.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What time is it now?
Dialogue: 1,0:34:24.83,0:34:25.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,两点半
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.83,0:34:25.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,2:30
Dialogue: 1,0:34:27.25,0:34:27.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,四天
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.25,0:34:27.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Four days
Dialogue: 1,0:34:29.88,0:34:31.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  它动起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.88,0:34:31.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, it's moving
Dialogue: 1,0:34:31.34,0:34:32.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你准备好去捉了没
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.34,0:34:32.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Are you ready to go for it?
Dialogue: 1,0:34:32.63,0:34:35.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板说过  机不可失
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.63,0:34:35.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Like Mr. Krabs says, it's now or never
Dialogue: 1,0:34:35.42,0:34:36.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么时候说的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.42,0:34:36.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,When does he say that?
Dialogue: 1,0:34:36.51,0:34:38.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,通常是上厕所的路上说
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.51,0:34:38.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Usually on his way into the men's room
Dialogue: 1,0:34:38.18,0:34:39.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,冲啊
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.18,0:34:39.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Banzai
Dialogue: 1,0:34:39.97,0:34:41.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我通常都这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.97,0:34:41.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's usually what I say
Dialogue: 1,0:34:45.60,0:34:47.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  它要逃走了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.60,0:34:47.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, he's taking evasive action
Dialogue: 1,0:34:47.68,0:34:48.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,最好两面夹击
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.68,0:34:48.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We better flank him
Dialogue: 1,0:34:48.81,0:34:49.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我左边夹
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.81,0:34:49.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll flank left
Dialogue: 1,0:34:49.60,0:34:50.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你右边夹
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.60,0:34:50.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You go right
Dialogue: 1,0:34:50.69,0:34:51.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,收到
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.69,0:34:51.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Roger that
Dialogue: 1,0:34:52.40,0:34:53.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,另一个右边  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.40,0:34:53.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Other right, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:35:12.08,0:35:14.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我好像把我脾脏摔坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.08,0:35:14.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I think I ruptured a spleen
Dialogue: 1,0:35:14.46,0:35:16.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我好像把我算盘摔碎了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.46,0:35:16.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I think I shattered my abacus
Dialogue: 1,0:35:16.84,0:35:17.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你什么
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.84,0:35:17.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Your what?
Dialogue: 1,0:35:17.42,0:35:18.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,算盘
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.42,0:35:18.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My abacus
Dialogue: 1,0:35:19.42,0:35:19.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没坏
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.42,0:35:19.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nope
Dialogue: 1,0:35:19.93,0:35:21.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,应该没事
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.93,0:35:21.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Seems okay
Dialogue: 1,0:35:21.97,0:35:22.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.97,0:35:22.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:35:22.68,0:35:23.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,它往那飞了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.68,0:35:23.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There it goes
Dialogue: 1,0:35:25.51,0:35:26.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,千万别停  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.51,0:35:26.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't stop now, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:35:26.43,0:35:27.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就快捉到它了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.43,0:35:27.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're gaining on him
Dialogue: 1,0:35:44.32,0:35:46.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,机不可失
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.32,0:35:46.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, it's now or never
Dialogue: 1,0:35:51.83,0:35:54.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们几个太花哨了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.83,0:35:54.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You boys is mighty colorful
Dialogue: 1,0:35:54.84,0:35:57.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要我说啊  有一点点太花哨了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.84,0:35:57.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,a smidgen too colorful, if you ask me
Dialogue: 1,0:35:58.30,0:36:01.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要我说啊  还有点重了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.30,0:36:01.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And too darn heavy, if you ask me
Dialogue: 1,0:36:01.93,0:36:04.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,其实派大星一直在减肥
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.93,0:36:02.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, actually
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.72,0:36:04.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick has been trying to shed a few pounds
Dialogue: 1,0:36:04.80,0:36:07.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,去跟鮟鱇大妈说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.80,0:36:07.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Tell it to ma angler
Dialogue: 1,0:36:13.73,0:36:15.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,说说看
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.73,0:36:15.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, tell me this
Dialogue: 1,0:36:15.36,0:36:19.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你一开始到那边的茅房干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.36,0:36:17.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What was it y'all was doing down yonder
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.77,0:36:19.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,at the outhouse in the first place?
Dialogue: 1,0:36:19.61,0:36:21.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我都说过了  大妈
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.61,0:36:21.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, I done told you, ma
Dialogue: 1,0:36:21.24,0:36:23.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我本来在  做事
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.24,0:36:23.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There I was, doing my duty
Dialogue: 1,0:36:23.95,0:36:27.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就跟其他星期天一个样
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.95,0:36:27.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,just like every other Sunday
Dialogue: 1,0:36:29.58,0:36:32.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,机不可失
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.58,0:36:32.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, it's now or never
Dialogue: 1,0:36:32.83,0:36:35.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,突然出现了猝不及防的一声叫
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.83,0:36:35.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,When with not so much as a warning shout
Dialogue: 1,0:36:35.50,0:36:40.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这些害虫从黑黑的野地那边掉出来
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.50,0:36:36.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,these here varmints
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.88,0:36:40.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,done dropped right out of the wild black yonder
Dialogue: 1,0:36:40.01,0:36:42.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,正好砸中了我脑袋
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.01,0:36:42.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,smack-dab onto my noggin
Dialogue: 1,0:36:42.93,0:36:46.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,而且还害得我脖子都痉挛了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.93,0:36:46.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Darn near give me a crick in the neck, it has, too
Dialogue: 1,0:36:46.72,0:36:48.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真的很抱歉打扰你们
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.72,0:36:48.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're really sorry for interrupting your--
Dialogue: 1,0:36:48.43,0:36:49.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,都闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.43,0:36:49.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Y'all hush up
Dialogue: 1,0:36:49.22,0:36:52.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,克莱图斯  你是不是又在吹牛了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.22,0:36:51.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, Cletus, is this another one of your tall tales
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.52,0:36:52.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,you tend to tell?
Dialogue: 1,0:36:52.31,0:36:54.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我真的没骗你  大妈
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.31,0:36:54.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I swears I ain't fibbing, ma
Dialogue: 1,0:36:54.98,0:36:55.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,克莱图斯
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.98,0:36:55.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Cletus
Dialogue: 1,0:36:55.81,0:36:57.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,问打嗝叔嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.81,0:36:57.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just ask uncle belcher
Dialogue: 1,0:36:57.77,0:36:59.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他会告诉你事情经过的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.77,0:36:59.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He'll tell you the whole story
Dialogue: 1,0:37:01.65,0:37:02.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.65,0:37:02.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 1,0:37:02.61,0:37:05.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不得不承认
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.61,0:37:05.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, I must admit one thing
Dialogue: 1,0:37:05.86,0:37:07.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他们好漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.86,0:37:07.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,They is awfully purty
Dialogue: 1,0:37:09.28,0:37:12.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,然而身为这个部落的首领
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.28,0:37:12.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nevertheless, as leader of this here clan
Dialogue: 1,0:37:12.62,0:37:13.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,也就是我
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.62,0:37:13.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,which I is
Dialogue: 1,0:37:13.75,0:37:16.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我必须要求这两个大漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.75,0:37:16.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I must subject these two purty folk
Dialogue: 1,0:37:16.58,0:37:20.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,进行入部落仪式  证明自己有价值
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.58,0:37:20.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to clan initiation rites to deem them worthy
Dialogue: 1,0:37:22.26,0:37:23.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么价值
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.26,0:37:23.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Worthy of what?
Dialogue: 1,0:37:23.38,0:37:24.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,具体说下
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.38,0:37:24.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Specifically
Dialogue: 1,0:37:24.01,0:37:25.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,活着的价值
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.01,0:37:25.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Of livin'
Dialogue: 1,0:37:27.30,0:37:28.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小弟
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.30,0:37:28.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Junior
Dialogue: 1,0:37:30.56,0:37:31.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,去拿你的琴过来
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.56,0:37:31.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Go and get your fiddle
Dialogue: 1,0:37:31.93,0:37:33.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好  好
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.93,0:37:33.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay
Dialogue: 1,0:37:40.98,0:37:41.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,琴
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.98,0:37:41.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Fiddle
Dialogue: 1,0:37:50.20,0:37:50.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你看  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.20,0:37:50.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Look, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:37:50.95,0:37:52.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他要给我们奏乐
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.95,0:37:52.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He's gonna play us a little song
Dialogue: 1,0:37:54.00,0:37:55.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好短的乐
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.00,0:37:55.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Short song
Dialogue: 1,0:37:55.33,0:37:56.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.33,0:37:56.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:37:56.12,0:37:59.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这个应该是音乐挑战
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.12,0:37:59.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I think this is meant to be a musical challenge
Dialogue: 1,0:37:59.79,0:38:00.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,挑战
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.79,0:38:00.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Challenge?
Dialogue: 1,0:38:03.01,0:38:05.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  可我们根本没乐器能奏啊
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.01,0:38:05.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, we don't even have an instrument to play
Dialogue: 1,0:38:08.14,0:38:11.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对  而且我们马上就没手能奏了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.14,0:38:11.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and soon we won't have anything to play it with
Dialogue: 1,0:38:12.10,0:38:13.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  等下
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.10,0:38:13.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, hang on
Dialogue: 1,0:38:17.69,0:38:19.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  别丢下我
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.69,0:38:19.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob, don't leave me
Dialogue: 1,0:38:19.52,0:38:20.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不至于  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.52,0:38:20.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't dream of it, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:38:20.52,0:38:21.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那就好
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.52,0:38:21.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All right
Dialogue: 1,0:38:49.47,0:38:51.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好耶  兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.47,0:38:51.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, all right, buddy
Dialogue: 1,0:38:55.35,0:38:57.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  虽然你赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.35,0:38:57.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, Patrick, even though you won
Dialogue: 1,0:38:57.18,0:38:59.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但看来他才是真正的明星
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.18,0:38:59.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,it looks like he was the real star
Dialogue: 1,0:39:05.15,0:39:06.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,贝西
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.15,0:39:06.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Betsy
Dialogue: 1,0:39:06.15,0:39:06.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.15,0:39:06.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes'm
Dialogue: 1,0:39:06.94,0:39:09.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在来比大喊大叫
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.94,0:39:09.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's time for a hootin' and hollerin' contest
Dialogue: 1,0:39:14.33,0:39:16.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  是歌唱挑战
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.33,0:39:16.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, it's a singing competition
Dialogue: 1,0:39:16.33,0:39:17.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.33,0:39:17.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 1,0:39:17.70,0:39:18.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.70,0:39:18.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't know
Dialogue: 1,0:39:19.08,0:39:22.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但是斗完琴感觉好渴
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.08,0:39:22.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But I sure am a-thirsty after that fiddlin'
Dialogue: 1,0:39:24.75,0:39:25.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给我一点
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.75,0:39:25.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Give me some of that
Dialogue: 1,0:39:39.39,0:39:41.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看来我们连胜了  对吧派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.39,0:39:41.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Looks like we're on a roll, eh, Patrick?
Dialogue: 1,0:39:43.73,0:39:44.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,打倒他  谢普
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.73,0:39:44.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Go get him, Shep
Dialogue: 1,0:39:45.19,0:39:46.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢普一定会给他好看
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.19,0:39:46.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Shep'll give him what for
Dialogue: 1,0:39:46.48,0:39:47.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,打倒他  谢普
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.48,0:39:47.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Go get him, Shep
Dialogue: 1,0:39:48.19,0:39:51.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我就爱看摔跤打斗赛
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.19,0:39:51.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I just love me some rassling and tussling
Dialogue: 1,0:39:55.83,0:39:56.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.83,0:39:56.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Bravissimo
Dialogue: 1,0:39:56.62,0:39:57.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真好看
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.62,0:39:57.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My compliments to the chef
Dialogue: 1,0:39:59.16,0:40:00.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,到你们了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.16,0:40:00.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Your turn
Dialogue: 1,0:40:01.37,0:40:04.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,其实  我跟我朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.37,0:40:04.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, actually, my friend and I
Dialogue: 1,0:40:04.46,0:40:06.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,并不喜欢摔跤
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.46,0:40:06.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,we don't like to rassle
Dialogue: 1,0:40:07.71,0:40:09.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们不喜欢摔跤吗
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.71,0:40:09.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You don't like to rassle?
Dialogue: 1,0:40:09.42,0:40:10.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.42,0:40:10.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,N-No
Dialogue: 1,0:40:10.05,0:40:11.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们不是很爱摔跤
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.05,0:40:11.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're not the rassling sort
Dialogue: 1,0:40:11.63,0:40:16.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那你们几个大漂亮喜欢玩什么
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.63,0:40:14.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, then, what in tarnation exactly
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.09,0:40:16.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,do you purty folk like to do for fun?
Dialogue: 1,0:40:16.35,0:40:18.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们喜欢捉水母
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.35,0:40:18.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, we like to go jellyfishing
Dialogue: 1,0:40:18.56,0:40:19.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,捉水母
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.56,0:40:19.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Jellyfishing
Dialogue: 1,0:40:19.81,0:40:22.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,捉水母是什么笨玩意
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.81,0:40:22.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What kind of tomfoolery is jellyfishing?
Dialogue: 1,0:40:22.44,0:40:24.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,差不多就像这样
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.44,0:40:24.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, it goes something like this
Dialogue: 1,0:40:29.23,0:40:30.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.23,0:40:30.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What the
Dialogue: 1,0:40:30.65,0:40:32.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,太恶心了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.65,0:40:32.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's disgusting
Dialogue: 1,0:40:32.82,0:40:33.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,趁现在  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.82,0:40:33.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:40:46.75,0:40:49.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,反正差不多就那样
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.75,0:40:49.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, something like that, anyway
Dialogue: 1,0:40:50.46,0:40:51.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,认识你真高兴  兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.46,0:40:51.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nice knowing you, buddy
Dialogue: 1,0:40:51.76,0:40:55.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,咱这边就没见有谁能伤成那样
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.76,0:40:53.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen anybody cutting up
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.55,0:40:55.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,like that around these parts
Dialogue: 1,0:40:55.05,0:40:56.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,自打小时候学上厕所算起
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.05,0:40:56.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,since we was potty training junior
Dialogue: 1,0:40:58.51,0:41:00.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大概13岁左右的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.51,0:41:00.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He was near about 13
Dialogue: 1,0:41:03.60,0:41:07.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他们实在是傻得不得了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.60,0:41:07.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Them boys is dumber than my box of rotten teeth
Dialogue: 1,0:41:11.36,0:41:12.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,加油啊
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.36,0:41:12.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Go get 'em, tiger
Dialogue: 1,0:41:14.03,0:41:15.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小孩子长得就是快
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.03,0:41:15.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,They grow up so fast
Dialogue: 1,0:41:17.16,0:41:19.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,身为这个部落的首领
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.16,0:41:19.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,As leader of this here clan
Dialogue: 1,0:41:19.41,0:41:21.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我特此册封你们
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.41,0:41:21.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I hereby dub you
Dialogue: 1,0:41:21.04,0:41:23.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵包包和派大心
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.04,0:41:23.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,sponge Joe Bob and Darryl
Dialogue: 1,0:41:23.87,0:41:26.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,为深海荣誉乡巴佬
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.87,0:41:26.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,honorary trenchbillies
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.17,0:41:27.88,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(804,196)}道具假牙
Dialogue: 1,0:41:33.72,0:41:34.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,演讲
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.72,0:41:34.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Speech
Dialogue: 1,0:41:34.42,0:41:35.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,演讲
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.42,0:41:35.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Speech
Dialogue: 1,0:41:35.68,0:41:38.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,如果真要我说句话
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.68,0:41:38.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess if I was to say one thing
Dialogue: 1,0:41:38.68,0:41:41.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那我要为派大星和自己发言
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.68,0:41:39.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and I think I'm speaking
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.80,0:41:41.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,for both Patrick and myself here
Dialogue: 1,0:41:41.60,0:41:44.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们大家真的非常友善
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.60,0:41:44.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,it's that y'all are a bunch of real kind folks
Dialogue: 1,0:41:44.43,0:41:46.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,而且认识你们真是高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.43,0:41:46.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and it's been a real hoot getting to know y'all
Dialogue: 1,0:41:49.23,0:41:51.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再见  友好的深海乡巴佬
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.23,0:41:51.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Farewell, friendly trenchbillies
Dialogue: 1,0:41:51.48,0:41:52.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,回头见
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.48,0:41:52.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,See you around
Dialogue: 1,0:41:52.28,0:41:53.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,拜拜
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.28,0:41:53.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Toodles
Dialogue: 1,0:41:54.69,0:41:58.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们这是想去哪
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.69,0:41:58.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And just where is it you folks think you're going?
Dialogue: 1,0:41:58.70,0:42:00.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,回家
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.70,0:42:00.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Over to home?
Dialogue: 1,0:42:00.12,0:42:03.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们现在是我们亲戚了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.12,0:42:03.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, you're one of our kin now
Dialogue: 1,0:42:03.33,0:42:05.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所以这就是你们家
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.33,0:42:05.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,so this is your home
Dialogue: 1,0:42:05.37,0:42:09.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,因此  你们将很荣幸
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.37,0:42:09.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and as such, you've been given the great honor
Dialogue: 1,0:42:09.54,0:42:11.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,能够照顾大妈
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.54,0:42:11.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,of taking care of ma
Dialogue: 1,0:42:11.34,0:42:15.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,以此度过余生
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.34,0:42:15.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,for the rest of your natural born lives
Dialogue: 1,0:42:15.05,0:42:17.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,照顾大妈
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.05,0:42:17.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Taking care of ma?
Dialogue: 1,0:42:17.18,0:42:18.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,以此度过余生
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.18,0:42:18.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Rest of our natural born lives?
Dialogue: 1,0:42:18.76,0:42:22.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就是帮她拿钱包  给腿肚按摩
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.76,0:42:22.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You know, carry her purse, give her calf massages
Dialogue: 1,0:42:22.47,0:42:26.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,晚上睡前给她念莎士比哑巴的作品
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.47,0:42:24.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,read her the Billy Shakespeare
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.93,0:42:29.27,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1148,788)}莎士比亚
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.22,0:42:26.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,till she falls asleep at night
Dialogue: 1,0:42:26.39,0:42:29.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大妈可喜欢抑扬格五音步了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.39,0:42:29.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Ma just loves iambic pentameter
Dialogue: 1,0:42:30.06,0:42:32.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,感觉好像很有意思
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.06,0:42:32.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, that all sounds like a lot of fun
Dialogue: 1,0:42:32.23,0:42:35.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但我在裤头村老家还有不少重任
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.23,0:42:33.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but I have responsibilities
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.90,0:42:35.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,back home at bikini bottom
Dialogue: 1,0:42:35.53,0:42:37.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有只宠物蜗牛得喂
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.53,0:42:37.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I have a pet snail to feed
Dialogue: 1,0:42:37.07,0:42:39.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,而且去蟹堡王上班还不能迟到
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.07,0:42:39.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and can't be late for work at the krusty krab
Dialogue: 1,0:42:39.70,0:42:44.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对啊  抑扬格五音步害我头疼死了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.70,0:42:44.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and iambic pentameter gives me a headache
Dialogue: 1,0:42:46.04,0:42:49.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们哪都别想去
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.04,0:42:49.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You folks ain't going nowhere
Dialogue: 1,0:42:50.46,0:42:51.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,拜托
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.46,0:42:51.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Please
Dialogue: 1,0:42:51.29,0:42:52.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,深海乡巴佬先生  我们能
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.29,0:42:52.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Trenchbilly, what can we--
Dialogue: 1,0:42:53.25,0:42:54.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你鞋带松了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.25,0:42:54.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Your shoe's untied
Dialogue: 1,0:42:54.67,0:42:55.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.67,0:42:55.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:42:55.13,0:42:56.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可我根本没穿
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.13,0:42:56.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But I ain't even wearing--
Dialogue: 1,0:42:57.92,0:42:58.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,该死
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.92,0:42:58.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,darn it
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.76,0:43:01.47,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(440,440)}蟹堡王
Dialogue: 1,0:42:59.34,0:43:01.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我该怎么跟他说  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.34,0:43:01.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, what was I supposed to tell him, Squidward?
Dialogue: 1,0:43:01.85,0:43:04.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你本来能告诉他可以退钱的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.85,0:43:04.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You could have told him he could have his money back
Dialogue: 1,0:43:04.35,0:43:05.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那可不行
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.35,0:43:05.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, I couldn't
Dialogue: 1,0:43:05.93,0:43:06.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.93,0:43:06.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 1,0:43:06.52,0:43:09.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,因为我早放收银机里了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.52,0:43:09.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Because I already put it in the register
Dialogue: 1,0:43:09.77,0:43:11.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.77,0:43:11.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:43:11.02,0:43:13.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们刚甩掉了一大群深海乡巴佬暴民
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.02,0:43:13.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We just escaped from an angry mob of deep-sea bumpkins
Dialogue: 1,0:43:13.77,0:43:15.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真是太可怕了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.77,0:43:15.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It was horrible
Dialogue: 1,0:43:15.23,0:43:17.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,而且他们还要让我们一辈子待那里
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.23,0:43:17.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,They were gonna make us stay forever
Dialogue: 1,0:43:17.61,0:43:19.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,帮他们大老母按摩
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.61,0:43:19.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and massage their grandma
Dialogue: 1,0:43:19.90,0:43:20.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所以呢
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.90,0:43:20.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So?
Dialogue: 1,0:43:21.07,0:43:22.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,干嘛跟我说这个
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.07,0:43:22.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why you telling me?
Dialogue: 1,0:43:22.24,0:43:23.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,因为他们跟过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.24,0:43:23.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,'Cause they followed us here
Dialogue: 1,0:43:34.21,0:43:35.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快出来
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.21,0:43:35.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on out
Dialogue: 1,0:43:35.55,0:43:37.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们肯定就在里面
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.55,0:43:37.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We know you're in there
Dialogue: 1,0:43:37.09,0:43:38.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对  快出来
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.09,0:43:38.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, come on out
Dialogue: 1,0:43:38.72,0:43:40.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们肯定就在里面
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.72,0:43:40.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We know you're in there
Dialogue: 1,0:43:41.76,0:43:44.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,欢迎光临蟹堡王
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.76,0:43:44.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the Krusty Krab
Dialogue: 1,0:43:44.39,0:43:45.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,需要点餐吗
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.39,0:43:45.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,May I take your order?
Dialogue: 1,0:43:49.18,0:43:50.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.18,0:43:50.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sure
Dialogue: 1,0:43:50.02,0:43:52.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我就来个大份蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.02,0:43:52.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll have me a large Krabby Patty
Dialogue: 1,0:43:52.40,0:43:54.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,配可乐
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.40,0:43:54.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,with a kola
Dialogue: 1,0:43:54.31,0:43:55.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不对不对
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.31,0:43:55.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, no, no
Dialogue: 1,0:43:55.15,0:43:56.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,柠檬水
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.15,0:43:56.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Lemon-lime
Dialogue: 1,0:44:03.16,0:44:04.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,继续做  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.16,0:44:04.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Keep 'em coming, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:44:04.87,0:44:08.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,长久以来就数这笔生意最赚
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.87,0:44:08.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is the most business we've seen in a long time
Dialogue: 1,0:44:08.24,0:44:09.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,遵命  船长
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.24,0:44:09.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Aye, aye, captain
Dialogue: 1,0:44:09.50,0:44:10.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要再拿点面包来
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.50,0:44:10.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna get some more buns
Dialogue: 1,0:44:10.87,0:44:12.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再来
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.87,0:44:12.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,More
Dialogue: 1,0:44:12.29,0:44:13.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再来
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.29,0:44:13.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,More
Dialogue: 1,0:44:13.83,0:44:15.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再来
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.83,0:44:15.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,More
Dialogue: 1,0:44:15.25,0:44:16.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再来
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.25,0:44:16.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,More
Dialogue: 1,0:44:17.96,0:44:19.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.96,0:44:19.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:44:20.05,0:44:21.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我就喜欢看这个
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.05,0:44:21.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's what I like to see
Dialogue: 1,0:44:21.97,0:44:24.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,她一定会是本周最佳客人
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.97,0:44:24.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,She's gonna make customer of the week
Dialogue: 1,0:44:27.01,0:44:28.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只要逮到有谁
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.01,0:44:28.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We catch anyone
Dialogue: 1,0:44:28.18,0:44:30.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,敢对我们大妈那样抛媚眼
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.18,0:44:30.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,making goo-goo eyes like that at our ma
Dialogue: 1,0:44:30.93,0:44:34.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就只代表一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.93,0:44:34.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,it can only mean one thing
Dialogue: 1,0:44:34.23,0:44:35.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他们要结为夫妻
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.23,0:44:35.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,They's gonna get hitched
Dialogue: 1,0:44:41.11,0:44:43.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.11,0:44:43.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.78,0:44:44.74,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(692,372)}已婚
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.08,0:44:49.20,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(766,706)}裤头村传说
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.46,0:44:53.87,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(724,772)}海绵火山爆发
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.00,0:44:55.25,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz27.52\pos(240,448)}分镜总监
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.00,0:44:56.54,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1096,976.667)}翻译{\fnArial}: 1440kHz
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.00,0:44:55.25,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz27.52\pos(480,710)}编剧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.33,0:44:56.54,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.51\pos(386,418)}创意总监
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.33,0:44:56.54,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.51\pos(514,662)}动画总监
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.63,0:44:58.09,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.51\pos(432,530)}制片指导
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.63,0:44:58.09,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1034.667,976.667)}本字幕仅限学习交流\N严禁用于商业用途
Dialogue: 1,0:45:02.92,0:45:04.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我有个全新
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.92,0:45:04.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I got a whole new
Dialogue: 1,0:45:04.51,0:45:06.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那是在唱歌吗
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.51,0:45:06.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Is that supposed to be singing?
Dialogue: 1,0:45:07.89,0:45:09.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,多半就是海绵宝宝了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.89,0:45:09.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I am putting that one on SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:45:10.89,0:45:13.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,能不能给我闭嘴  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.89,0:45:13.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Would you clam up, SpongeBob?
Dialogue: 1,0:45:13.02,0:45:14.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我还得在里面画画
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.02,0:45:14.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I am trying to paint in here
Dialogue: 1,0:45:14.73,0:45:17.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我珍爱着我的好邻居
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.73,0:45:17.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I cherish my fellow residents
Dialogue: 1,0:45:17.90,0:45:19.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.90,0:45:19.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:45:19.32,0:45:20.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你唱什么唱
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.32,0:45:20.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 1,0:45:21.03,0:45:22.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我只是想给大家呈现
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.03,0:45:22.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm just displaying for all to see
Dialogue: 1,0:45:22.57,0:45:24.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我感恩的态度
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.57,0:45:24.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,an attitude of gratitude
Dialogue: 1,0:45:24.74,0:45:25.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,感恩
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.74,0:45:25.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gratitude?
Dialogue: 1,0:45:25.66,0:45:27.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你都玩一早上的垃圾了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.66,0:45:27.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You've been wallowing in filth all morning
Dialogue: 1,0:45:27.78,0:45:29.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还能感什么恩
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.78,0:45:29.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What could you possibly be grateful for?
Dialogue: 1,0:45:29.87,0:45:30.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快出来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.87,0:45:30.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hit it, boys
Dialogue: 1,0:45:30.91,0:45:32.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一二三四
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.91,0:45:32.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,One, two, three, four
Dialogue: 1,0:45:36.37,0:45:39.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我有个全新的态度
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.37,0:45:39.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've got a whole new attitude
Dialogue: 1,0:45:39.50,0:45:42.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,订阅了一辈子的感恩书
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.50,0:45:42.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,a lifetime subscription to gratitude
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.50,0:45:42.92,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(874,418)}感恩杂志
Dialogue: 1,0:45:43.34,0:45:46.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,朋友  一定要让自己变心舒
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.34,0:45:46.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Friend, you've got to change your glad-itude
Dialogue: 1,0:45:46.93,0:45:49.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,活出感恩的好态度
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.93,0:45:49.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,live an attitude of gratitude
Dialogue: 1,0:45:50.05,0:45:53.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我为我的一生而感恩
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.05,0:45:53.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm grateful for the life I am living
Dialogue: 1,0:45:53.85,0:45:56.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谁知道我还能活多久
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.85,0:45:56.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Who knows how long I will have it?
Dialogue: 1,0:45:57.19,0:46:00.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我为拥有的一切而感恩
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.19,0:46:00.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm thankful for all I've been given
Dialogue: 1,0:46:00.73,0:46:03.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一定要让感恩变成好习惯
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.73,0:46:03.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We make appreciation a habit
Dialogue: 1,0:46:03.99,0:46:06.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,活在当下最美好
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.99,0:46:06.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There's no time like the present day
Dialogue: 1,0:46:06.03,0:46:07.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,努力才会有回报
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.03,0:46:07.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to have a present come your way
Dialogue: 1,0:46:07.78,0:46:10.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,必须时时刻刻把握
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.78,0:46:10.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All you have to do is grab it
Dialogue: 1,0:46:11.24,0:46:14.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这样你就会了解到
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.24,0:46:14.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So now I think that you will see
Dialogue: 1,0:46:14.33,0:46:14.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,了解到
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.33,0:46:14.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You'll see
Dialogue: 1,0:46:14.83,0:46:19.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你已别无所求
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.83,0:46:19.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There's nothing more you need
Dialogue: 1,0:46:19.54,0:46:22.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的朋友  这不是陈腔滥调
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.54,0:46:22.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My friend, this ain't no platitude
Dialogue: 1,0:46:22.92,0:46:23.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,滥调
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.92,0:46:23.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Platitude
Dialogue: 1,0:46:23.67,0:46:26.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只是充满感恩的态度
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.67,0:46:26.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just an attitude of gratitude
Dialogue: 1,0:46:26.47,0:46:26.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,感恩
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.47,0:46:26.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gratitude
Dialogue: 1,0:46:27.55,0:46:28.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥  照你这种情况
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.55,0:46:28.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Or in your case, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:46:28.84,0:46:30.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,感恩可别感帽了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.84,0:46:30.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,an attitude of hat-itude
Dialogue: 1,0:46:33.10,0:46:35.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给我拿走你帽子  拿走你感恩
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.10,0:46:35.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Keep your hat and your gratitude
Dialogue: 1,0:46:35.68,0:46:39.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,因为当你邻居让我没什么好感恩的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.68,0:46:36.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,'cause being your neighbor
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.94,0:46:39.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,leaves me with nothing to be grateful for
Dialogue: 1,0:46:45.49,0:46:46.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.49,0:46:46.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:46:46.07,0:46:48.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你真应该考虑一下检查你家水管
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.07,0:46:47.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You should really consider
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.20,0:46:48.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,getting your plumbing looked at
Dialogue: 1,0:46:48.36,0:46:49.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,全都要怪你
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.36,0:46:49.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is your fault
Dialogue: 1,0:46:49.91,0:46:50.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你放心  兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.91,0:46:50.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, buddy
Dialogue: 1,0:46:50.99,0:46:52.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我可以帮你一把
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.99,0:46:52.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can give you a hand
Dialogue: 1,0:46:52.16,0:46:52.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不用
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.16,0:46:52.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:46:52.70,0:46:54.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你已经帮够倒忙了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.70,0:46:54.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You have helped me enough
Dialogue: 1,0:46:54.24,0:46:58.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我再也用不着你来帮忙了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.24,0:46:58.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't want your help ever again
Dialogue: 1,0:46:58.41,0:47:00.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没问题  兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.41,0:47:00.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No problem, pal
Dialogue: 1,0:47:02.04,0:47:02.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.04,0:47:02.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Moron
Dialogue: 1,0:47:09.01,0:47:10.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,破水管
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.01,0:47:10.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Stupid pipe
Dialogue: 1,0:47:17.10,0:47:17.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.10,0:47:17.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Great
Dialogue: 1,0:47:17.68,0:47:18.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这下上班要迟到了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.68,0:47:18.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now I'm late for work
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.98,0:47:23.82,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(384,402)}蟹堡王
Dialogue: 1,0:47:24.48,0:47:25.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,借过
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.48,0:47:25.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Pardon me
Dialogue: 1,0:47:26.82,0:47:29.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,走慢点  飞毛腿
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.82,0:47:29.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Slow down, speedster
Dialogue: 1,0:47:30.95,0:47:32.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一边凉快去
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.95,0:47:32.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Go jump in a coral bed
Dialogue: 1,0:47:32.91,0:47:35.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥先生  我都跟你说多少次了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.91,0:47:35.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Squidward, how many times do I have to tell you?
Dialogue: 1,0:47:35.95,0:47:39.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,客人的笑话永远都好笑
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.95,0:47:39.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The customers' jokes are always funny
Dialogue: 1,0:47:39.41,0:47:41.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快给这位先生笑一声
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.41,0:47:41.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, give the gentleman a chuckle
Dialogue: 1,0:47:45.13,0:47:48.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我就知道你到头来会听懂这笑话
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.13,0:47:48.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I knew you'd eventually get it, dude
Dialogue: 1,0:47:55.89,0:47:58.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别盯着我看  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.89,0:47:58.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Stop staring, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:47:58.22,0:47:59.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你都影响到我生产力了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.22,0:47:59.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're affecting my productivity
Dialogue: 1,0:48:03.23,0:48:05.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我想来份蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.23,0:48:05.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I would like to order one Krabby Patty
Dialogue: 1,0:48:05.06,0:48:06.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一共三块钱
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.06,0:48:06.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That will be $3
Dialogue: 1,0:48:06.32,0:48:07.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一分钱硬币收吗
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.32,0:48:07.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Do you accept pennies?
Dialogue: 1,0:48:07.61,0:48:09.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我没空数这么多硬币
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.61,0:48:09.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't have time to count all that
Dialogue: 1,0:48:09.11,0:48:10.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那就随你便
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.11,0:48:10.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, have it your way
Dialogue: 1,0:48:10.74,0:48:13.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我换别家花零钱去
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.74,0:48:13.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll just take my loose change elsewhere
Dialogue: 1,0:48:13.45,0:48:14.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,求之不得
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.45,0:48:14.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Please do
Dialogue: 1,0:48:14.53,0:48:16.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我这边还得干活呢
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.53,0:48:16.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to get some work done here
Dialogue: 1,0:48:17.20,0:48:20.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,总有刁民想浪费你时间
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.20,0:48:20.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Some people just want to waste your time
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.45,0:48:21.71,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(956,520)}台灯
Dialogue: 1,0:48:22.92,0:48:23.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.92,0:48:23.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, buddy
Dialogue: 1,0:48:24.88,0:48:28.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你踩个没完没了要我怎么集中注意力
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.88,0:48:26.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to focus
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.25,0:48:28.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,with all that incessant tapping?
Dialogue: 1,0:48:28.34,0:48:31.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你这是在干什么  先生
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.34,0:48:31.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And what do you think you're doing, sir?
Dialogue: 1,0:48:31.55,0:48:34.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我在给漂亮女生开门
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.55,0:48:34.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm holding the door for the nice lady
Dialogue: 1,0:48:34.05,0:48:35.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不准你开
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.05,0:48:35.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, you're not
Dialogue: 1,0:48:35.30,0:48:38.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你印得玻璃上到处是你的脏鳍印
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.30,0:48:37.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're leaving your grubby fin-prints
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.14,0:48:38.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,all over the glass
Dialogue: 1,0:48:38.60,0:48:42.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,害得我还得亲自去清理掉
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.60,0:48:42.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and now yours truly is gonna have to clean it up
Dialogue: 1,0:48:42.10,0:48:45.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么个个都在加大我工作的难度
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.10,0:48:45.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why does everyone insist on making my job so difficult?
Dialogue: 1,0:48:46.27,0:48:48.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你老是把垃圾留桌上
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.27,0:48:48.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You always leave trash on the table
Dialogue: 1,0:48:49.48,0:48:51.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你牙老是打颤
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.48,0:48:51.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Your teeth chatter
Dialogue: 1,0:48:51.53,0:48:53.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你帽子难看到我了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.53,0:48:53.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Your hat annoys me
Dialogue: 1,0:48:53.86,0:48:56.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你上厕所太久了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.86,0:48:56.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You take too long in the restroom
Dialogue: 1,0:48:56.28,0:48:57.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,态度
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.28,0:48:57.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Attitude
Dialogue: 1,0:48:58.16,0:49:01.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还有海绵宝宝  能不能别唱那歌了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.16,0:49:01.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And, SpongeBob, would you quit singing that song?
Dialogue: 1,0:49:01.91,0:49:03.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么了  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.91,0:49:03.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Squidward?
Dialogue: 1,0:49:03.62,0:49:06.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你没有感恩的态度吗
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.62,0:49:06.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't you have an attitude of gratitude?
Dialogue: 1,0:49:07.17,0:49:09.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  我恨我的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.17,0:49:09.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob, I hate my job
Dialogue: 1,0:49:09.71,0:49:13.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,而且还跟差邻居住穷乡僻壤里
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.71,0:49:13.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and I live in a dead-end town with neighbors I can't stand
Dialogue: 1,0:49:13.42,0:49:16.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我就是全裤头村最悲惨的那位
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.42,0:49:16.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm the most miserable person in bikini bottom
Dialogue: 1,0:49:16.34,0:49:18.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还有什么好感恩的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.34,0:49:18.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What do I have to be thankful for?
Dialogue: 1,0:49:18.55,0:49:20.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,情况会更糟
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.55,0:49:20.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, it could be worse
Dialogue: 1,0:49:20.68,0:49:25.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,都住裤头村了  还能糟到哪去
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.68,0:49:25.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How could life in bikini bottom possibly get any worse?
Dialogue: 1,0:49:26.73,0:49:28.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,裤头山要爆发了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.73,0:49:28.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mount bikini bottom is erupting
Dialogue: 1,0:49:30.69,0:49:31.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就那么糟
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.69,0:49:31.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's how
Dialogue: 1,0:49:31.61,0:49:32.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好酷
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.61,0:49:32.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Cool
Dialogue: 1,0:49:35.82,0:49:36.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快看
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.82,0:49:36.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Look
Dialogue: 1,0:49:36.53,0:49:37.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,屋顶
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.53,0:49:37.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The roof
Dialogue: 1,0:49:40.95,0:49:43.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一群跟风狗  连岩浆都怕
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.95,0:49:43.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You lemmings, afraid of a little lava?
Dialogue: 1,0:49:45.33,0:49:46.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的钱
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.33,0:49:46.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Cashie
Dialogue: 1,0:49:47.38,0:49:49.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.38,0:49:49.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:49:49.13,0:49:52.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别天降大火大搞破坏啊
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.13,0:49:52.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Make it stop raining this fiery destruction
Dialogue: 1,0:49:53.51,0:49:54.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉打扰你哭  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.51,0:49:54.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry to interrupt your crying, Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:49:55.13,0:49:56.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,起码也得先躲一下
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.13,0:49:56.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but shouldn't we get to a place
Dialogue: 1,0:49:56.26,0:49:58.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,至少也找个岩浆下不到的地方吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.26,0:49:57.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that at least doesn't have a roof
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.30,0:49:58.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,with lava coming through it?
Dialogue: 1,0:50:03.52,0:50:04.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别怕
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.52,0:50:04.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Fear not
Dialogue: 1,0:50:04.35,0:50:05.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,避难所不远了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.35,0:50:05.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Shelter can't be far away
Dialogue: 1,0:50:06.19,0:50:08.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,何苦呢  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.19,0:50:08.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why even bother, SpongeBob?
Dialogue: 1,0:50:08.65,0:50:09.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看不出来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.65,0:50:09.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Can't you see?
Dialogue: 1,0:50:09.94,0:50:12.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们所熟知的文明正在灰飞烟灭
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.94,0:50:12.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Civilization as we know it is crumbling to dust
Dialogue: 1,0:50:12.65,0:50:14.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,社会秩序正在崩溃
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.65,0:50:14.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Civic order is in tatters
Dialogue: 1,0:50:14.61,0:50:16.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只能自求多福了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.61,0:50:16.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's every man for himself
Dialogue: 1,0:50:16.15,0:50:17.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别无他法了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.15,0:50:17.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There's no other way
Dialogue: 1,0:50:18.16,0:50:21.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我需要你们的生命精华
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.16,0:50:21.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna need your life essence
Dialogue: 1,0:50:23.29,0:50:25.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们几个小朋友还待外面干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.29,0:50:25.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What are you boys doing out still?
Dialogue: 1,0:50:25.50,0:50:27.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,火山避难所还有不少空位
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.50,0:50:27.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Plenty of room at the volcano shelter
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.21,0:50:27.92,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(664,450)}火山避难所
Dialogue: 1,0:50:28.04,0:50:29.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不准再胡闹了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.04,0:50:29.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But no more roughhousing
Dialogue: 1,0:50:29.83,0:50:30.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,听到没
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.83,0:50:30.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You got that?
Dialogue: 1,0:50:30.92,0:50:32.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那就好  老太太
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.92,0:50:32.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course, ma'am
Dialogue: 1,0:50:32.50,0:50:34.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大家尽量乖一点
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.50,0:50:34.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Try and behave yourself, fellers
Dialogue: 1,0:50:35.42,0:50:38.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,市民们别激动
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.42,0:50:38.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No need to get excited, citizens
Dialogue: 1,0:50:38.26,0:50:41.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,政府正在不辞辛劳
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.26,0:50:41.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Your government is working tirelessly
Dialogue: 1,0:50:41.18,0:50:43.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,解决这座邪恶火山
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.18,0:50:43.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to defeat this evil volcano
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.06,0:50:43.43,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(454,862)}市长
Dialogue: 1,0:50:43.72,0:50:44.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们得怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.72,0:50:44.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 1,0:50:44.85,0:50:45.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别慌
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.85,0:50:45.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't worry
Dialogue: 1,0:50:45.77,0:50:47.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们都控制好了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.77,0:50:47.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We've got it under control
Dialogue: 1,0:50:47.85,0:50:48.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这还控制好了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.85,0:50:48.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Under control?
Dialogue: 1,0:50:48.98,0:50:50.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大半座城市都着火了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.98,0:50:50.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Half the city's on fire
Dialogue: 1,0:50:50.56,0:50:52.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你还管那叫控制好了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.56,0:50:52.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You call that "under control"?
Dialogue: 1,0:50:52.94,0:50:53.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.94,0:50:53.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Do you?
Dialogue: 1,0:50:55.19,0:50:56.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,末日就要到了  市长
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.19,0:50:56.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The end is near, mayor
Dialogue: 1,0:50:56.69,0:50:58.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那位说得对
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.69,0:50:58.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That guy's onto something
Dialogue: 1,0:50:58.53,0:51:00.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你在隐瞒什么  市长
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.53,0:51:00.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What are you hiding from us, mayor?
Dialogue: 1,0:51:00.11,0:51:01.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有什么秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.11,0:51:01.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Do you have some secret?
Dialogue: 1,0:51:01.49,0:51:02.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,末日就要到了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.49,0:51:02.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Is the end near?
Dialogue: 1,0:51:02.62,0:51:03.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.62,0:51:03.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:51:03.24,0:51:06.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快点回答
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.24,0:51:06.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Answer the question
Dialogue: 1,0:51:06.16,0:51:07.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,市长先生
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.16,0:51:07.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Mayor
Dialogue: 1,0:51:07.21,0:51:09.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,市长先生  我有话要说
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.21,0:51:09.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Mayor, please, I've got something
Dialogue: 1,0:51:09.87,0:51:11.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,请讲
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.87,0:51:11.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes, boy
Dialogue: 1,0:51:11.17,0:51:14.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你说我们怎么办才能阻止火山
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.17,0:51:14.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How do you propose we stop the volcano?
Dialogue: 1,0:51:14.09,0:51:17.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,其实  我是想问违停罚单的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.09,0:51:15.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Actually, I just had a question
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.71,0:51:17.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,about these parking tickets
Dialogue: 1,0:51:17.38,0:51:18.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我根本没车
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.38,0:51:18.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't have a car
Dialogue: 1,0:51:18.80,0:51:20.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,白痴一个
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.80,0:51:20.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy, moron
Dialogue: 1,0:51:20.55,0:51:21.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们完蛋了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.55,0:51:21.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're doomed
Dialogue: 1,0:51:23.85,0:51:25.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,笨蛋一群
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.85,0:51:25.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You fools
Dialogue: 1,0:51:25.85,0:51:26.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你谁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.85,0:51:26.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 1,0:51:30.85,0:51:35.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我是一名远古战士
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.85,0:51:35.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I am an ancient warrior from long ago
Dialogue: 1,0:51:35.57,0:51:37.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我族之遗孤
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.57,0:51:37.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,the last of my kind
Dialogue: 1,0:51:37.57,0:51:43.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,曾在开天辟地前统治着海洋
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.57,0:51:43.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,who ruled over the ocean from before the dawn of time
Dialogue: 1,0:51:43.37,0:51:47.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可惜  我的族人灭绝了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.37,0:51:47.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But alas, my people were wiped out
Dialogue: 1,0:51:47.58,0:51:50.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,罪魁祸首便是现在危害着你们的火山
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.58,0:51:50.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,by the same volcano that plagues you now
Dialogue: 1,0:51:50.87,0:51:52.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那你怎么活下来的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.87,0:51:52.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Then how did you survive?
Dialogue: 1,0:51:54.96,0:51:58.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我之所以活下来  是因为只有我
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.96,0:51:58.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I survived because I was the only one
Dialogue: 1,0:51:58.76,0:52:00.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,才知道怎么阻止它
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.76,0:52:00.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,who knew how to stop it
Dialogue: 1,0:52:01.38,0:52:03.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那就别吊胃口了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.38,0:52:03.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, don't keep us in suspense
Dialogue: 1,0:52:03.51,0:52:04.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么个阻止法
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.51,0:52:04.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How did you stop it?
Dialogue: 1,0:52:04.85,0:52:08.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们必须献祭
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.85,0:52:08.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You must make a sacrifice
Dialogue: 1,0:52:09.81,0:52:12.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,献祭个什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.81,0:52:12.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What kind of sacrifice?
Dialogue: 1,0:52:12.02,0:52:17.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,献祭出来的必须是最悲惨那位
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.02,0:52:17.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A sacrifice must be made of the most miserable person
Dialogue: 1,0:52:17.78,0:52:18.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我就知道
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.78,0:52:18.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I knew it
Dialogue: 1,0:52:18.94,0:52:21.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,必须献祭最悲惨的那位
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.94,0:52:21.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We have to sacrifice the most miserable person
Dialogue: 1,0:52:21.65,0:52:23.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那会是谁呢
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.65,0:52:23.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And who would that be?
Dialogue: 1,0:52:23.16,0:52:25.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,肯定不是我
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.16,0:52:25.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, it certainly isn't me
Dialogue: 1,0:52:28.33,0:52:29.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.33,0:52:29.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:52:29.20,0:52:31.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你觉得谁是最悲惨的那位
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.20,0:52:31.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,who do you think is the most miserable person?
Dialogue: 1,0:52:31.16,0:52:31.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.16,0:52:31.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't know
Dialogue: 1,0:52:31.75,0:52:32.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不在乎
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.75,0:52:32.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't care
Dialogue: 1,0:52:32.21,0:52:33.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可是章鱼哥  都当务之急
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.21,0:52:33.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But, Squidward, it's imperative that--
Dialogue: 1,0:52:33.96,0:52:37.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可是章鱼哥  都当务之急个鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.96,0:52:37.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But, Squidward, it is imperative that we nothing
Dialogue: 1,0:52:37.55,0:52:41.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我宁愿冒险去火山
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.55,0:52:41.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I think I'd rather take my chances with the volcano
Dialogue: 1,0:52:41.51,0:52:44.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,也不要困在这个悲惨破洞里
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.51,0:52:44.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,than be stuck in this miserable barnacle hole
Dialogue: 1,0:52:44.51,0:52:47.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,陪着你  还有这座傻子镇里的居民
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.51,0:52:47.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,with you and the citizens of dum-dum town
Dialogue: 1,0:52:48.64,0:52:49.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么就傻了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.64,0:52:49.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're idiots now?
Dialogue: 1,0:52:49.47,0:52:50.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我聪明得很
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.47,0:52:50.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm a very smart woman
Dialogue: 1,0:52:50.64,0:52:52.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好好好
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.64,0:52:52.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nice, nice
Dialogue: 1,0:52:52.10,0:52:52.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.10,0:52:52.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:52:54.90,0:52:56.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,悲惨章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.90,0:52:56.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Miserable Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:52:56.94,0:52:57.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你太悲惨了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.94,0:52:57.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You are miserable
Dialogue: 1,0:52:57.86,0:52:58.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一群白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.86,0:52:58.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You idiots
Dialogue: 1,0:52:58.65,0:52:59.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们抓错了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.65,0:52:59.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You got the wrong guy
Dialogue: 1,0:52:59.90,0:53:01.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们都听到你骂脏手印的事了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.90,0:53:01.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We heard you complaining about the fingerprints
Dialogue: 1,0:53:01.94,0:53:03.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还有踩个没完没了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.94,0:53:03.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And the foot tapping
Dialogue: 1,0:53:03.45,0:53:04.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还有我零钱
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.45,0:53:04.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And my loose change
Dialogue: 1,0:53:04.82,0:53:06.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还有我牙齿
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.82,0:53:06.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And my teeth
Dialogue: 1,0:53:06.49,0:53:07.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还有他帽子
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.49,0:53:07.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And his hat
Dialogue: 1,0:53:07.87,0:53:09.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你还骂水管破
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.87,0:53:09.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And you called the pipe stupid
Dialogue: 1,0:53:09.74,0:53:11.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,而且你刚刚还说
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.74,0:53:11.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And the fact that you said
Dialogue: 1,0:53:11.25,0:53:13.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你是全裤头村最悲惨的那位
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.25,0:53:13.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,you were the most miserable person in bikini bottom
Dialogue: 1,0:53:13.92,0:53:16.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我就是全裤头村最悲惨的那位
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.92,0:53:16.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm the most miserable person in bikini bottom
Dialogue: 1,0:53:17.29,0:53:18.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,能不能
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.29,0:53:18.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Would you just
Dialogue: 1,0:53:22.92,0:53:24.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,放我下来  一群暴民
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.92,0:53:24.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let me down, you goons
Dialogue: 1,0:53:24.63,0:53:26.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉  章鱼哥先生
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.63,0:53:26.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Mr. Tentacles
Dialogue: 1,0:53:26.59,0:53:27.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大家把他丢进去
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.59,0:53:27.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Throw him in, fellas
Dialogue: 1,0:53:29.64,0:53:30.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.64,0:53:30.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait
Dialogue: 1,0:53:31.43,0:53:33.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,害章鱼哥悲惨的就是我
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.43,0:53:33.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It is I who makes Squidward miserable
Dialogue: 1,0:53:33.35,0:53:34.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,改丢我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.35,0:53:34.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Throw me in instead
Dialogue: 1,0:53:35.48,0:53:36.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,合情合理
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.48,0:53:36.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Works for me
Dialogue: 1,0:53:38.06,0:53:40.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,很高兴你们都恢复理智了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.06,0:53:40.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm glad you all came to your senses
Dialogue: 1,0:53:40.57,0:53:41.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一帮忘恩负义的
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.57,0:53:41.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Bunch of ingrates
Dialogue: 1,0:53:41.65,0:53:42.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  快跳进去
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.65,0:53:42.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on, SpongeBob, jump in
Dialogue: 1,0:53:43.69,0:53:44.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.69,0:53:44.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:53:45.61,0:53:47.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  救命
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.61,0:53:47.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob, help
Dialogue: 1,0:53:47.53,0:53:48.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,虽然我很想
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.53,0:53:48.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'd love to, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:53:48.49,0:53:50.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可你说用不着我再来帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.49,0:53:50.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but you said to not help you ever again
Dialogue: 1,0:53:50.58,0:53:53.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,而且我当你邻居让你没什么好感恩的
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.58,0:53:51.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and that being my neighbor
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.70,0:53:53.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,left you with nothing to be grateful for
Dialogue: 1,0:53:53.45,0:53:54.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我保证过的
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.45,0:53:54.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I made a promise
Dialogue: 1,0:53:56.04,0:53:57.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我收回
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.04,0:53:57.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I take it back
Dialogue: 1,0:54:00.92,0:54:02.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,求你了  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.92,0:54:02.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Please, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:54:02.38,0:54:04.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我都是说着玩的
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.38,0:54:04.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean any of that
Dialogue: 1,0:54:04.84,0:54:07.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我感恩你的友情
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.84,0:54:07.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I do appreciate your friendship
Dialogue: 1,0:54:07.09,0:54:08.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我很感恩
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.09,0:54:08.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I am grateful
Dialogue: 1,0:54:08.97,0:54:09.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.97,0:54:09.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 1,0:54:10.26,0:54:10.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.26,0:54:10.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 1,0:54:12.47,0:54:15.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我为我的一生而感恩
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.47,0:54:15.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm grateful for the life I'm living
Dialogue: 1,0:54:15.23,0:54:17.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谁知道我还能活多久
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.23,0:54:17.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Who knows how long I'll have it?
Dialogue: 1,0:54:18.23,0:54:20.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我跟你学的  记得吗
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.23,0:54:20.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I learned that from you, remember?
Dialogue: 1,0:54:22.02,0:54:23.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大家再见了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.02,0:54:23.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good-bye, everyone
Dialogue: 1,0:54:29.53,0:54:30.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.53,0:54:30.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:54:30.78,0:54:32.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我就知道你会那么想
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.78,0:54:32.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I always knew you felt that way
Dialogue: 1,0:54:33.49,0:54:34.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.49,0:54:34.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Buddy
Dialogue: 1,0:54:34.33,0:54:36.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢谢你终于对大家敞开心扉了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.33,0:54:36.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thanks for finally opening up to us
Dialogue: 1,0:54:52.68,0:54:54.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的家
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.68,0:54:54.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My house
Dialogue: 1,0:54:55.47,0:54:58.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,火山受到了安抚
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.47,0:54:58.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now the volcano is appeased
Dialogue: 1,0:54:58.48,0:55:01.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可你不是说必须要献祭
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.48,0:55:01.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But I thought you said a sacrifice had to be made
Dialogue: 1,0:55:01.02,0:55:02.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,最可悲的那位来着
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.02,0:55:02.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,of the most miserable person
Dialogue: 1,0:55:02.57,0:55:03.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不对
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.57,0:55:03.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:55:03.44,0:55:05.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我话都没说完
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.44,0:55:05.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You didn't let me finish
Dialogue: 1,0:55:05.32,0:55:06.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我是要说
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.32,0:55:06.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I was trying to say
Dialogue: 1,0:55:06.69,0:55:10.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,献祭的是最可悲那位的家
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.69,0:55:10.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,a sacrifice of the most miserable person's house
Dialogue: 1,0:55:10.95,0:55:13.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大家都不听我说
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.95,0:55:13.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No one ever listens to me
Dialogue: 1,0:55:22.79,0:55:24.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,跟你说  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.79,0:55:24.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You know, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:55:24.00,0:55:26.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,鉴于刚刚发生的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.00,0:55:26.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,in light of everything that just happened
Dialogue: 1,0:55:27.13,0:55:28.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我骗了你
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.13,0:55:28.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I lied to you
Dialogue: 1,0:55:28.72,0:55:31.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我什么都不感恩
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.72,0:55:31.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I am not grateful for anything
Dialogue: 1,0:55:31.55,0:55:32.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看看我自己
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.55,0:55:32.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I mean, look at me
Dialogue: 1,0:55:32.93,0:55:35.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,连个睡觉的地方都没有了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.93,0:55:35.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't even have a roof to sleep under anymore
Dialogue: 1,0:55:36.18,0:55:37.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那可不至于
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.18,0:55:37.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, I wouldn't say that
Dialogue: 1,0:55:43.44,0:55:44.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给我滚
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.44,0:55:44.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Go away
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.32,0:55:47.44,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(766,706)}裤头村传说
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.45,0:55:52.11,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(738,860)}鳗婆婆的诅咒
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.20,0:55:53.16,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz27.52\pos(270,460)}分镜总监
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.20,0:55:55.20,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1096,976.667)}翻译{\fnArial}: 1440kHz
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.20,0:55:53.16,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz27.52\pos(492,710)}编剧
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.24,0:55:54.20,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.51\pos(390,414)}创意总监
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.24,0:55:54.20,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.51\pos(510,660)}动画总监
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.28,0:55:55.20,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.51\pos(432,530)}制片指导
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.33,0:55:56.33,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.51\pos(432,530)}客串
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.33,0:55:56.33,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1034.667,976.667)}本字幕仅限学习交流\N严禁用于商业用途
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.45,0:56:00.37,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(276,596)}蟹堡王
Dialogue: 1,0:56:06.64,0:56:09.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,天啊  还好我没忘带雨伞
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.64,0:56:09.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Boy, good thing I remembered my umbrella
Dialogue: 1,0:56:09.25,0:56:10.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.25,0:56:10.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Me too
Dialogue: 1,0:56:19.22,0:56:20.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来吧  孩子们
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.22,0:56:20.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on, kids
Dialogue: 1,0:56:25.20,0:56:27.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可惜我忘了带雨伞
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.20,0:56:27.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Too bad I forgot my umbrella
Dialogue: 1,0:56:28.30,0:56:31.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,又一个成功的营业日结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.30,0:56:31.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The end of another successful business day
Dialogue: 1,0:56:31.30,0:56:32.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,跟你说  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.30,0:56:32.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You know, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:56:32.30,0:56:35.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,每到这个点  我都会想起
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.30,0:56:35.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,this time of day always reminds me of
Dialogue: 1,0:56:35.73,0:56:36.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,钱
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.73,0:56:36.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Money
Dialogue: 1,0:56:39.05,0:56:40.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对对对  说得对
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.05,0:56:40.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, that's right
Dialogue: 1,0:56:41.67,0:56:45.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我还得接着在这干活  你倒是
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.67,0:56:45.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll just be here working while you do--
Dialogue: 1,0:56:55.95,0:56:58.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对不起  阿姨
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.95,0:56:58.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, ma'am
Dialogue: 1,0:56:59.20,0:57:00.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们关门了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.20,0:57:00.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But we're closed
Dialogue: 1,0:57:04.83,0:57:07.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看得出来你很饿  但是
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.83,0:57:07.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I see you're hungry, but--
Dialogue: 1,0:57:11.14,0:57:13.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但是我们真关门了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.14,0:57:13.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But we really are closed
Dialogue: 1,0:57:14.72,0:57:15.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.72,0:57:15.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thank you
Dialogue: 1,0:57:15.66,0:57:16.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,下次惠顾
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.66,0:57:16.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come again
Dialogue: 1,0:57:17.46,0:57:19.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,关门就是关门了  老太
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.46,0:57:19.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Closed means closed, grandma
Dialogue: 1,0:57:28.90,0:57:30.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,天啊  某些人真没素质
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.90,0:57:30.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Boy, some people
Dialogue: 1,0:57:33.01,0:57:36.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,麻烦来一份蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.01,0:57:36.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,One Krabby Patty, please
Dialogue: 1,0:57:36.83,0:57:38.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,都说了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.83,0:57:38.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I told you
Dialogue: 1,0:57:38.07,0:57:39.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们关门了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.07,0:57:39.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're closed
Dialogue: 1,0:57:39.57,0:57:41.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我本来十分钟前就该下班的
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.57,0:57:41.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I was supposed to get out of here ten minutes ago
Dialogue: 1,0:57:42.15,0:57:45.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,更何况  收银机里的钱都清点过了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.15,0:57:45.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And besides, I already cashed the register out
Dialogue: 1,0:57:45.64,0:57:45.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可我
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.64,0:57:45.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But I--
Dialogue: 1,0:57:45.94,0:57:46.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.94,0:57:46.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nope
Dialogue: 1,0:57:47.05,0:57:47.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.05,0:57:47.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I--
Dialogue: 1,0:57:47.40,0:57:47.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.40,0:57:47.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:57:47.94,0:57:48.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.94,0:57:48.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I--
Dialogue: 1,0:57:48.40,0:57:49.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不可以
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.40,0:57:49.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No way
Dialogue: 1,0:57:49.44,0:57:50.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.44,0:57:50.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Please?
Dialogue: 1,0:57:50.45,0:57:51.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.45,0:57:51.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I--
Dialogue: 1,0:57:51.13,0:57:51.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别想
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.13,0:57:51.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Never
Dialogue: 1,0:57:52.00,0:57:54.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我带的零钱刚刚好
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.00,0:57:54.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I brought exact change
Dialogue: 1,0:58:01.00,0:58:02.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你那点钱
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.00,0:58:02.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That is what they cost
Dialogue: 1,0:58:02.76,0:58:04.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是二十年前的价格
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.76,0:58:04.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,20 years ago
Dialogue: 1,0:58:04.12,0:58:07.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹黄堡现在一个四块五  阿姨
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.12,0:58:07.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Krabby Patties cost $4.50 these days, lady
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.41,0:58:07.21,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(702,274)}菜单
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.41,0:58:07.21,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(284,540)}蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 1,0:58:07.45,0:58:08.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.45,0:58:08.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, dear
Dialogue: 1,0:58:08.77,0:58:11.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我好像只差了一块钱
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.77,0:58:11.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Seems I'm just one short
Dialogue: 1,0:58:12.15,0:58:13.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不行  老太
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.15,0:58:13.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No way, granny
Dialogue: 1,0:58:13.86,0:58:15.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可我就只有这么多
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.86,0:58:15.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But it's all I have
Dialogue: 1,0:58:15.72,0:58:17.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.72,0:58:17.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Please?
Dialogue: 1,0:58:17.17,0:58:17.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.17,0:58:17.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nope
Dialogue: 1,0:58:18.02,0:58:19.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.02,0:58:19.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Please?
Dialogue: 1,0:58:20.79,0:58:22.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好惨啊
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.79,0:58:22.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How terribly sad
Dialogue: 1,0:58:22.56,0:58:23.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.56,0:58:23.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Please?
Dialogue: 1,0:58:24.15,0:58:25.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.15,0:58:25.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Please
Dialogue: 1,0:58:36.62,0:58:38.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们下次都给我
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.62,0:58:38.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You haven't seen the last of
Dialogue: 1,0:58:38.72,0:58:42.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,走着瞧
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.72,0:58:42.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Me
Dialogue: 1,0:58:46.50,0:58:48.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我早看够了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.50,0:58:48.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, I've certainly seen enough
Dialogue: 1,0:58:50.72,0:58:52.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好一位诡异的老盲鳗
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.72,0:58:52.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What a creepy old hagfish
Dialogue: 1,0:58:52.77,0:58:53.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还以为她要赖在这
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.77,0:58:53.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I thought she'd never leave
Dialogue: 1,0:58:53.92,0:58:56.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,干得漂亮  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.92,0:58:56.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Aye, good job, there, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:58:56.70,0:58:59.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你说了什么话赶她走的
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.70,0:58:59.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Say, what did you tell her that finally drove her out?
Dialogue: 1,0:58:59.65,0:59:02.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我可能得了解一下  免得她再回来
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.65,0:59:02.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I may need to know in case she ever comes back
Dialogue: 1,0:59:04.84,0:59:06.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,得了解一下  免得她再
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.84,0:59:06.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"Need to know in case she ever"--
Dialogue: 1,0:59:21.42,0:59:23.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,晚安  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.42,0:59:23.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Have a good night, Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:59:23.59,0:59:25.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你也一样  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.59,0:59:25.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You too, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:59:25.00,0:59:25.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,祝你晚
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.00,0:59:25.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Have a good
Dialogue: 1,0:59:29.80,0:59:30.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,安
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.80,0:59:30.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Night?
Dialogue: 1,0:59:36.99,0:59:37.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,老婆婆
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.99,0:59:37.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Old lady?
Dialogue: 1,0:59:37.89,0:59:38.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,老婆婆
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.89,0:59:38.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Old lady?
Dialogue: 1,0:59:39.40,0:59:40.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我在这
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.40,0:59:40.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Here I am
Dialogue: 1,0:59:43.22,0:59:45.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就在约定碰面的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.22,0:59:45.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Right where you told me to meet you
Dialogue: 1,0:59:45.92,0:59:48.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,其实我跟你是约在往左边两步的位置
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.92,0:59:48.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Actually, I told you to meet me two paces to the left
Dialogue: 1,0:59:51.54,0:59:52.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,很好  你到了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.54,0:59:52.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good, you're here
Dialogue: 1,0:59:53.36,0:59:54.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,东西带来了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.36,0:59:54.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I brought the stuff
Dialogue: 1,0:59:55.65,0:59:57.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.65,0:59:57.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My goodness
Dialogue: 1,0:59:57.40,1:00:00.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这一定是我遇过最善良最慷慨
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.40,1:00:00.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This has to be the most kind, most generous
Dialogue: 1,1:00:00.96,1:00:05.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,最贴心的事  以前从没人对我这么好
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.96,1:00:05.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,most thoughtful thing anyone has ever done for me
Dialogue: 1,1:00:05.75,1:00:06.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不客气
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.75,1:00:06.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're welcome
Dialogue: 1,1:00:06.31,1:00:07.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,趁没人看到  赶紧收下
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.31,1:00:07.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just take it before someone sees us
Dialogue: 1,1:00:07.86,1:00:08.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,太迟了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.86,1:00:08.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Too late
Dialogue: 1,1:00:09.00,1:00:10.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.00,1:00:10.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,1:00:10.15,1:00:11.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,原来是真的
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.15,1:00:11.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So it's true
Dialogue: 1,1:00:11.98,1:00:13.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们怎么发现的
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.98,1:00:13.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How did you find out?
Dialogue: 1,1:00:13.65,1:00:14.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,发什么现
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.65,1:00:14.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Find out?
Dialogue: 1,1:00:14.50,1:00:17.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你还是太嫩了点  得多练练
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.50,1:00:17.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Boy, you'd have to get up pretty early in the morning
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.50,1:00:17.11,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(578,920)}必 须 很 早 起 床
Dialogue: 1,1:00:17.11,1:00:21.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,才能往屁股塞俩蟹黄堡混过我蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.11,1:00:21.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to sneak a pair of buns like these past old Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,1:00:21.63,1:00:24.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不然起码也得赶在他摘掉安眠眼罩前
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.63,1:00:24.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Or at least before he takes off his sleep mask
Dialogue: 1,1:00:24.17,1:00:26.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你怎么知道我戴安眠眼罩的
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.17,1:00:26.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How did you know I wore a sleep mask?
Dialogue: 1,1:00:26.80,1:00:27.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,求你了  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.80,1:00:27.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Please, Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,1:00:27.83,1:00:28.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别开除我
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.83,1:00:28.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,don't fire me
Dialogue: 1,1:00:29.13,1:00:31.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,求你了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.13,1:00:31.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Please
Dialogue: 1,1:00:31.80,1:00:36.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蝾螈之眼  冻鲨皮囊
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.80,1:00:36.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Eye of newt and frozen shark skin slab
Dialogue: 1,1:00:36.93,1:00:40.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我在此诅咒蟹堡王
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.93,1:00:40.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I hereby curse the Krusty Krab
Dialogue: 1,1:00:48.95,1:00:51.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们这可不是救济厨房  小子
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.95,1:00:51.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We are not a soup kitchen, boy
Dialogue: 1,1:00:51.07,1:00:53.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这俩的钱从你工资扣
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.07,1:00:53.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And these will be coming out of your paycheck
Dialogue: 1,1:00:54.17,1:00:56.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,更何况  我们可不想鼓励
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.17,1:00:56.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Besides, we don't want to encourage
Dialogue: 1,1:00:57.64,1:00:58.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,做慈善
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.64,1:00:58.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Charity
Dialogue: 1,1:00:58.30,1:00:59.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可是那个
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.30,1:00:59.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But what about the--
Dialogue: 1,1:00:59.54,1:01:01.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那个
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.54,1:01:01.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,the--
Dialogue: 1,1:01:01.47,1:01:03.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小子  有话快说
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.47,1:01:03.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on, boy, spit it out
Dialogue: 1,1:01:03.40,1:01:04.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那个
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.40,1:01:04.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The--
Dialogue: 1,1:01:04.00,1:01:05.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来检查一下里面的情况
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.00,1:01:05.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's see what's under the hood
Dialogue: 1,1:01:06.15,1:01:08.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那个
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.15,1:01:08.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The--
Dialogue: 1,1:01:09.38,1:01:10.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好了  这样就行了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.38,1:01:10.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There, that should do it
Dialogue: 1,1:01:11.35,1:01:12.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可是那个诅咒怎么办
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.35,1:01:12.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But what about the curse?
Dialogue: 1,1:01:12.87,1:01:13.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,诅咒吗
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.87,1:01:13.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The curse?
Dialogue: 1,1:01:13.89,1:01:15.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小子  让我解释一下诅咒的事
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.89,1:01:15.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Boy, let me explain something about curses
Dialogue: 1,1:01:15.97,1:01:18.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,用我曾爷爷以前常讲的小故事解释吧
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.97,1:01:17.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,with a little short story
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.06,1:01:18.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,me great-grandpappy used to tell me
Dialogue: 1,1:01:20.88,1:01:21.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好吧  开讲了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.88,1:01:21.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes, here we go
Dialogue: 1,1:01:22.27,1:01:24.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,诅咒都是扯淡
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.27,1:01:24.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Curses are nonsense
Dialogue: 1,1:01:24.52,1:01:25.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是吗  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.52,1:01:25.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,They are, Mr. Krabs?
Dialogue: 1,1:01:25.95,1:01:26.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.95,1:01:26.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yep
Dialogue: 1,1:01:26.49,1:01:28.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,都是胡编乱造的迷信
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.49,1:01:28.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just totally fabricated superstition
Dialogue: 1,1:01:28.78,1:01:29.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对吧  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.78,1:01:29.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Right, Squidward?
Dialogue: 1,1:01:29.74,1:01:32.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,诅咒的事你问错人了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.74,1:01:32.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're asking the wrong guy about curses
Dialogue: 1,1:01:32.06,1:01:33.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我都住海绵宝宝隔壁了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.06,1:01:33.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I live next door to SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,1:01:35.79,1:01:37.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看吧  小子
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.79,1:01:37.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,See, boy?
Dialogue: 1,1:01:37.00,1:01:39.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就一个疯婆子在那瞎扯淡而已
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.00,1:01:39.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just the maniacal ramblings of an old lady
Dialogue: 1,1:01:40.21,1:01:41.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没什么好担心的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.21,1:01:41.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nothing to worry about
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.51,1:01:42.92,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(378,430)}蟹堡王
Dialogue: 1,1:01:45.82,1:01:47.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥  我开始有点担心了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.82,1:01:47.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward, I'm starting to get worried
Dialogue: 1,1:01:47.87,1:01:51.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,莫名感觉蟹堡王真的被诅咒了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.87,1:01:48.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I got a funny feeling
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.89,1:01:51.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that the Krusty Krab really is cursed
Dialogue: 1,1:01:51.12,1:01:52.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,为什么呢
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.12,1:01:52.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And why is that?
Dialogue: 1,1:01:52.92,1:01:56.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,整个早上一个客人都没看到
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.92,1:01:56.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, we haven't seen a single customer all morning
Dialogue: 1,1:01:56.48,1:01:57.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那不是诅咒
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.48,1:01:57.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's not a curse
Dialogue: 1,1:01:59.87,1:02:00.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是祝福
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.87,1:02:00.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's a blessing
Dialogue: 1,1:02:02.08,1:02:02.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,说得对
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.08,1:02:02.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're right
Dialogue: 1,1:02:02.99,1:02:04.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没有诅咒这回事
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.99,1:02:04.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There's no such thing as curses
Dialogue: 1,1:02:13.62,1:02:16.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的钱
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.62,1:02:16.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Me money
Dialogue: 1,1:02:31.90,1:02:32.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我来救
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.90,1:02:32.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I got it
Dialogue: 1,1:02:32.41,1:02:33.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我来救
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.41,1:02:33.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I got it
Dialogue: 1,1:02:36.14,1:02:37.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,烫
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.14,1:02:37.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hot
Dialogue: 1,1:02:48.04,1:02:49.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我没救到
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.04,1:02:49.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't got it
Dialogue: 1,1:02:49.95,1:02:51.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,刚想起来
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.95,1:02:51.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I just remembered
Dialogue: 1,1:02:51.18,1:02:53.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我合同里有个不得爆粗口的条款
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.18,1:02:53.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,there's a "no curse" clause in my contract
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.18,1:02:53.46,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(884,920)}有 诅 咒
Dialogue: 1,1:02:53.46,1:02:54.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,合作愉快
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.46,1:02:54.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nice working with you
Dialogue: 1,1:02:54.63,1:02:55.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥  别走
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.63,1:02:55.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward, wait
Dialogue: 1,1:02:55.72,1:02:57.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你根本没签合同啊
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.72,1:02:57.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You don't even have a contract
Dialogue: 1,1:02:57.46,1:03:00.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,反正合同里也有个不得签合同的条款
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.46,1:03:00.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There's a "no contract" clause in it too
Dialogue: 1,1:03:02.87,1:03:04.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板  你为什么会这么确定
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.87,1:03:04.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs, what makes you so sure
Dialogue: 1,1:03:04.88,1:03:06.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就算找到那个老婆婆
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.88,1:03:06.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that even if we find that old lady
Dialogue: 1,1:03:06.27,1:03:07.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,她也会解除诅咒呢
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.27,1:03:07.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,she'll lift the curse?
Dialogue: 1,1:03:08.12,1:03:09.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没事  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.12,1:03:09.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,1:03:09.55,1:03:14.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对付这种情况  蟹老板自有妙计
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.55,1:03:12.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs has a special technique
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.14,1:03:14.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,for dealing with situations like these
Dialogue: 1,1:03:14.95,1:03:18.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那就叫做  苦苦哀求法
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.95,1:03:18.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's called begging and pleading
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.39,1:03:20.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,75,,很多小时后
Dialogue: 1,1:03:21.77,1:03:24.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  看来没办法找得到
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.77,1:03:24.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, SpongeBob, I don't think we're ever gonna find--
Dialogue: 1,1:03:24.58,1:03:25.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板  快看
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.58,1:03:25.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs, look
Dialogue: 1,1:03:25.78,1:03:29.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真是好家伙  小子
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.78,1:03:29.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll be the slimy son of a slippery sea slug, boy
Dialogue: 1,1:03:29.59,1:03:30.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,找到她了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.59,1:03:30.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's her
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.87,1:03:36.12,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(342,348)}鳗婆婆\N营业中\N停船费{\fnArial}5{\fnAdobe 黑体 Std R}元
Dialogue: 1,1:03:33.09,1:03:34.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给我个合理的理由
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.09,1:03:34.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Give me one good reason
Dialogue: 1,1:03:34.50,1:03:36.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,说明为什么我该解除诅咒
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.50,1:03:36.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,why I should lift the curse
Dialogue: 1,1:03:36.30,1:03:37.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,因为如果你不解除
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.30,1:03:37.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Because if you don't
Dialogue: 1,1:03:37.85,1:03:39.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的生意就会永远毁了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.85,1:03:39.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,me business will be ruined forever
Dialogue: 1,1:03:39.94,1:03:42.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我说  给我个合理的理由
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.94,1:03:42.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I said, "give me a good reason"
Dialogue: 1,1:03:43.33,1:03:45.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,求你了  鳗婆婆
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.33,1:03:45.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Please, madame hagfish
Dialogue: 1,1:03:45.30,1:03:46.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,求你了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.30,1:03:46.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Please
Dialogue: 1,1:03:46.77,1:03:48.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我会做任何事
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.77,1:03:48.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll do anything
Dialogue: 1,1:03:48.53,1:03:51.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,任何事都行
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.53,1:03:51.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Anything at all
Dialogue: 1,1:03:52.40,1:03:54.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我就喜欢哀求的人
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.40,1:03:54.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I like a man who begs
Dialogue: 1,1:03:55.28,1:03:55.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看吧
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.28,1:03:55.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 1,1:03:55.86,1:03:56.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就说了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.86,1:03:56.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Told you
Dialogue: 1,1:03:56.85,1:03:58.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我会解除诅咒的
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.85,1:03:58.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I will lift the curse
Dialogue: 1,1:03:59.15,1:04:03.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,条件是你们俩要完成一项危险的任务
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.15,1:04:03.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,provided the two of you complete a dangerous task
Dialogue: 1,1:04:03.83,1:04:05.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,先等一下  老太
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.83,1:04:05.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, wait a minute, granny
Dialogue: 1,1:04:05.26,1:04:06.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这部分可不算
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.26,1:04:06.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That wasn't part of the--
Dialogue: 1,1:04:06.32,1:04:07.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,任何事都行  伟大的鳗婆婆
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.32,1:04:07.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Anything, o great hagfish
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.78,1:04:09.95,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(780,218)}任务    危险任务    无聊任务   欢乐任务
Dialogue: 1,1:04:11.04,1:04:18.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,带给我巨型金鳗咽喉里的神圣古金币
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.04,1:04:14.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Bring me the sacred gold doubloon
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.28,1:04:18.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,from the throat of the giant golden eel
Dialogue: 1,1:04:20.30,1:04:22.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.30,1:04:22.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 1,1:04:24.07,1:04:25.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一定就是这了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.07,1:04:25.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, this must be it
Dialogue: 1,1:04:25.44,1:04:26.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,金鳗的巢穴
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.44,1:04:26.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The lair of the golden eel
Dialogue: 1,1:04:26.71,1:04:28.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么看出来的
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.71,1:04:28.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How could you tell?
Dialogue: 1,1:04:28.17,1:04:29.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,她把它名片给我了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.17,1:04:29.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,She gave me its business card
Dialogue: 1,1:04:34.40,1:04:35.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.40,1:04:35.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,1:04:36.20,1:04:39.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你觉得我们踩到的这坨软乎乎的玩意
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.20,1:04:39.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,so you think this fudgy stuff we're walking in
Dialogue: 1,1:04:39.09,1:04:40.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,会不会是金鳗它
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.09,1:04:40.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,might be the eel's--
Dialogue: 1,1:04:40.30,1:04:41.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,吃剩的布丁吗
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.30,1:04:41.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Leftover pudding?
Dialogue: 1,1:04:41.85,1:04:42.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对  我也这么觉得
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.85,1:04:42.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes, I thought that too
Dialogue: 1,1:04:42.98,1:04:44.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等一下  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.98,1:04:44.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hold it, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,1:04:44.30,1:04:44.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.30,1:04:44.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Look
Dialogue: 1,1:04:45.48,1:04:47.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是金鳗
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.48,1:04:47.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's the eel
Dialogue: 1,1:04:47.44,1:04:49.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,吃了布丁容易睡着
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.44,1:04:49.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, nappy time always comes after pudding
Dialogue: 1,1:04:50.05,1:04:52.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,趁它没醒  从它喉咙里取金币
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.05,1:04:51.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's go get the doubloon from his throat
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.45,1:04:52.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,before he wakes up
Dialogue: 1,1:04:52.52,1:04:53.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好主意
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.52,1:04:53.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good idea
Dialogue: 1,1:04:53.72,1:04:55.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小心不要
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.72,1:04:55.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And be careful not to--
Dialogue: 1,1:05:00.12,1:05:01.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,它醒了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.12,1:05:01.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He's awake
Dialogue: 1,1:05:06.62,1:05:08.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小心它的尾巴
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.62,1:05:08.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Look out for his tail
Dialogue: 1,1:05:08.16,1:05:08.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.16,1:05:08.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Quick
Dialogue: 1,1:05:08.62,1:05:09.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,找东西来
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.62,1:05:09.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Find something to
Dialogue: 1,1:05:10.40,1:05:11.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,掩护
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.40,1:05:11.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hide behind
Dialogue: 1,1:05:17.07,1:05:18.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,已经天亮了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.07,1:05:18.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Morning already?
Dialogue: 1,1:05:21.41,1:05:22.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我来了  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.41,1:05:22.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm coming, Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,1:05:22.85,1:05:24.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不要乱跑
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.85,1:05:24.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't go anywhere
Dialogue: 1,1:05:24.19,1:05:26.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,想走我也走不了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.19,1:05:26.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I really don't have a choice
Dialogue: 1,1:05:26.51,1:05:28.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,接招
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.51,1:05:28.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Take this
Dialogue: 1,1:05:31.58,1:05:32.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,干得漂亮  小子
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.58,1:05:32.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good job, laddie
Dialogue: 1,1:05:33.04,1:05:35.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还没完呢
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.04,1:05:35.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're not finished yet
Dialogue: 1,1:05:36.78,1:05:39.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我来接
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.78,1:05:39.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I got it
Dialogue: 1,1:05:42.67,1:05:43.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我没接到
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.67,1:05:43.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't got it
Dialogue: 1,1:05:46.23,1:05:50.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,鳗婆婆  你要的古金币到手了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.23,1:05:50.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Madame hagfish, we have the gold doubloon you asked for
Dialogue: 1,1:05:51.64,1:05:52.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,终于啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.64,1:05:52.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Finally
Dialogue: 1,1:05:57.26,1:05:58.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,麻烦洗干净
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.26,1:05:58.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Clean, please
Dialogue: 1,1:06:01.40,1:06:04.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在该兑现承诺  解除诅咒了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.40,1:06:04.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now it's time to lift that curse like you promised
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.35,1:06:09.73,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(684,302)}关
Dialogue: 1,1:06:06.57,1:06:07.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.57,1:06:07.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There you go
Dialogue: 1,1:06:07.27,1:06:08.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,诅咒解除了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.27,1:06:08.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The curse is lifted
Dialogue: 1,1:06:08.62,1:06:09.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,打烊标牌
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.62,1:06:09.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A "closed" sign?
Dialogue: 1,1:06:10.30,1:06:11.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就这
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.30,1:06:11.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's it?
Dialogue: 1,1:06:11.62,1:06:12.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,诅咒就这
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.62,1:06:12.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's the curse?
Dialogue: 1,1:06:13.05,1:06:14.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你以为我会把高级的诅咒
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.05,1:06:14.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You think I'm going to waste good spells
Dialogue: 1,1:06:14.82,1:06:16.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,浪费在你这臭鱼烂虾身上吗
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.82,1:06:16.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,on a bottom-feeder like you?
Dialogue: 1,1:06:16.84,1:06:18.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.84,1:06:18.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Have a nice day
Dialogue: 1,1:06:26.37,1:06:28.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,早说了吧  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.37,1:06:28.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, it's like I told you before, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,1:06:28.95,1:06:32.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,世上根本没有诅咒  也没巫婆
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.95,1:06:32.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There ain't no such thing as curses or witches
Dialogue: 1,1:06:32.25,1:06:34.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,也没海洋魔法生物  也没
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.25,1:06:34.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,or magical sea creatures or--
Dialogue: 1,1:06:37.07,1:06:37.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,感觉到了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.07,1:06:37.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Do you feel that?
